Proceed to payment' => 'Lean air adhart gu pàigheadh','Shipping method' => 'Modh luingeis','Additional notes' => 'Notaichean a bharrachd','Payment method' => 'Modh pàighidh','Step %1$s of %2$s' => 'Ceum %1$s à %2$s','Change: %s' => 'Atharrachadh: %s','Not selected yet.' => 'Gun taghadh fhathast.','Same as shipping address' => 'Coltach ri seòladh luingeis','Same as billing address' => 'Coltach ris an t-seòladh cunntais','Order summary' => 'Geàrr-chunntas òrdugh','Edit cart' => 'Deasaich cairt','Did you mean %s?' => 'An robh thu a&#39; ciallachadh %s?','Change email address to: {suggestion-value}' => 'Atharraich an seòladh puist-d gu: {suggestion-value}','This is a required field.' => 'Is e raon riatanach a tha seo.','This is not a valid email address.' => 'Chan e seòladh puist-d dligheach a tha seo.','This field does not match the related field value.' => 'Chan eil an raon seo a rèir luach an raoin co-cheangailte.','The CPF number "{cpf_number}" is invalid.' => 'Tha an àireamh CPF “{cpf_number}” mì-dhligheach.','The CNPJ number "{cnpj_number}" is invalid.' => 'Tha an àireamh CNPJ “{cnpj_number}” mì-dhligheach.','(Required)' => '(Riatanach)','Checkout Header - Desktop' => 'Ceann-cinn Checkout - Deasg','Display widgets on the checkout header for large screens. Only displayed if using the plugin\'s checkout header.' => 'Seall widgets air a’ bhann-cinn pàighidh airson scrionaichean mòra. Cha tèid a thaisbeanadh ach ma chleachdas tu bann-cinn pàighidh a’ plugan.','Checkout Header - Mobile' => 'Ceann-cinn pàighidh - Mobile','Display widgets below the checkout header for mobile devices. Only displayed if using the plugin\'s checkout header.' => 'Seall widgets fon bhann-cinn pàighidh airson innealan gluasadach. Cha tèid a thaisbeanadh ach ma chleachdas tu bann-cinn pàighidh a’ plugan.','Checkout Sidebar' => 'Sidebar checkout','Display widgets on the checkout sidebar after the order summary.' => 'Seall widgets air a’ bhàr-taobh pàighidh às deidh geàrr-chunntas an òrduigh.','Checkout Order Summary' => 'Geàrr-chunntas Òrdugh Checkout','Display widgets inside the order summary at the checkout page.' => 'Seall widgets taobh a-staigh geàrr-chunntas an òrduigh air an duilleag pàighidh.','Checkout Below Place Order' => 'Checkout Fo òrdugh àite','Display widgets below the place order button at the checkout page.' => 'Seall widgets fon phutan òrdugh àite aig an duilleag pàighidh.','Checkout Footer' => 'Checkout Footer','Display widgets on the checkout footer. Only displayed if using the plugin\'s checkout footer.' => 'Seall widgets air bonn-coise an t-seic. Cha tèid a thaisbeanadh ach ma chleachdas tu bonn-coise pàighidh a’ phlugan.','Classic' => 'Clasaigeach','Boxed' => 'Bogsa','Split' => 'Sgoilt','Minimalist' => 'Minimalist','Fluid Checkout and Delivery Date plugins by CodeRockz' => 'Plugins Checkout Fluid agus Ceann-latha Lìbhrigeadh le CodeRockz','<p>We detected that you are using the plugins Delivery & Pickup Date Time for WooCommerce (free and PRO) by CodeRockz. Integration with these plugins have been moved to Fluid Checkout PRO.</p>' => '<p>Lorg sinn gu bheil thu a’ cleachdadh na plugins Lìbhrigeadh &amp; Ceann-latha Ceann-latha airson WooCommerce (an-asgaidh agus PRO) le CodeRockz. Chaidh amalachadh leis na plugins sin a ghluasad gu Fluid Checkout PRO.</p>','Upgrade to PRO' => 'Àrdachadh gu PRO','Fluid Checkout database updated successfully' => 'Stòr-dàta Fluid Checkout air ùrachadh gu soirbheachail','The database changes where applied successfully.' => 'Bidh an stòr-dàta ag atharrachadh far an deach a chur an sàs gu soirbheachail.','Dismiss' => 'Cur às','Fluid Checkout database update' => 'Luchdaich a-nuas an stòr-dàta fluid checkout','Some changes to the database are required. As with any update, we recommend you to <strong>take a full backup of your website before proceeding</strong>.' => 'Tha feum air beagan atharraichean air an stòr-dàta. Coltach ri ùrachadh sam bith, tha sinn a’ moladh dhut <strong>cùl-taic slàn a ghabhail den làrach-lìn agad mus lean thu air adhart</strong> .','Update database' => 'Luchdaich a-nuas an stòr-dàta','Fluid Checkout is not compatible with the Divi Builder checkout layout' => 'Chan eil Fluid Checkout co-chòrdail ri cruth pàighidh Divi Builder','<p>Fluid Checkout needs the classic WooCommerce shortcode-based checkout form to work. When using the Divi Builder to customize the look and feel of the checkout page, the classic shortcodes are replaced with custom widgets from the Divi Builder for each part of the checkout page. These custom widgets are not compatible with Fluid Checkout.</p><p>Please edit your checkout page replacing the Divi Builder widgets with the a text widget containing the shortcode <code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code>.</p>' => '<p>Feumaidh Fluid Checkout am foirm pàighidh clasaigeach WooCommerce stèidhichte air shortcode gus obrachadh. Nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh Divi Builder gus coltas agus faireachdainn na duilleige pàighidh a ghnàthachadh, thèid widgets àbhaisteach bho Divi Builder a chuir an àite nan shortcodes clasaigeach airson gach pàirt den duilleag pàighidh. Chan eil na widgets àbhaisteach seo co-chòrdail ri Fluid Checkout.</p><p> Feuch an deasaich thu an duilleag pàighidh agad an àite widgets Divi Builder le widget teacsa anns a bheil an shortcode <code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code> .</p>','Edit the checkout page' => 'Deasaich an duilleag pàighidh','Read the documentation.' => 'Leugh na sgrìobhainnean.','Germanized PRO multistep checkout feature needs to be disabled when using Fluid Checkout' => 'Feumaidh feart pàighidh ioma-cheum PRO Gearmailteach a bhith ciorramach nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh Fluid Checkout','When using Fluid Checkout, the multistep feature from the Germanized PRO plugin becomes unnecessary and can cause <strong>critical errors while processing new orders</strong>. Please disable the Germanized PRO multistep checkout feature in the plugin settings.' => 'Nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh Fluid Checkout, bidh am feart ioma-cheum bhon plugan Germanized PRO a’ fàs neo-riatanach agus faodaidh e <strong>mearachdan èiginneach adhbhrachadh fhad ‘s a tha thu a’ giullachd òrdughan ùra</strong> . Feuch an cuir thu à comas am feart pàighidh ioma-cheum PRO Gearmailteach ann an roghainnean nam plugan.','Go to Germanized settings' => 'Rach gu roghainnean Gearmailteach','Thanks for choosing Fluid Checkout!' => 'Tapadh leibh airson a bhith a’ taghadh Fluid Checkout!','You have been using the plugin for a while now. How do you like it so far? <br>Please give us a quick rating, we appreciate every bit of feedback and it encourages us to keep improving the plugin :)' => 'Tha thu air a bhith a’ cleachdadh am plugan airson greis a-nis. Ciamar a tha e a’ còrdadh riut gu ruige seo?<br> Feuch an toir thu rangachadh sgiobalta dhuinn, tha sinn a’ cur luach air a h-uile fios air ais agus tha e gar brosnachadh gus leantainn air adhart ag adhartachadh am plugan :)','Rate the plugin' => 'Dèan measadh air a’ plugan','I need help!' => 'Tha feum agam air cuideachadh!','Some features of WooCommerce Checkout Manager by Quadlayers might not work as expected when using it with Fluid Checkout. Read <a href="%s">our documentation</a> for more information and alternative solutions.' => 'Is dòcha nach obraich cuid de fheartan WooCommerce Checkout Manager le Quadlayers mar a bhiodh dùil nuair a bhios tu ga chleachdadh le Fluid Checkout. Leugh <a href="%s">na sgrìobhainnean againn</a> airson tuilleadh fiosrachaidh agus fuasglaidhean eile.','Read documentation' => 'Leugh sgrìobhainnean','Don\'t show this again' => 'Na seall seo a-rithist','Fluid Checkout PRO' => 'Fluid Checkout PRO','More design templates' => 'Barrachd teamplaidean dealbhaidh','Optimized cart page' => 'Duilleag cairt làn-leasaichte','Optimized order received / thank you page' => 'Òrdugh as fheàrr air fhaighinn / duilleag taing','Edit cart contents at checkout page' => 'Deasaich susbaint a’ chairt aig duilleag pàighidh','Account matching / user matching' => 'Co-fhreagairt cunntais / maids cleachdaiche','Trust symbols on the cart and thank you pages' => 'Urras samhlaidhean air a &#39;chairt agus duilleagan taing','More positions for the coupon code on the checkout page' => 'Barrachd shuidheachaidhean airson a’ chòd coupon air an duilleag pàighidh','International phone numbers' => 'Àireamhan fòn eadar-nàiseanta','Gift messages and packing slips' => 'Teachdaireachdan tiodhlac agus bileagan pacaidh','Local pickup and in-store collection' => 'Togail ionadail agus cruinneachadh a-staigh','EU-VAT Assistant' => 'Neach-taic EU-VAT','I already have it – Hide this offer' => 'Tha e agam mu thràth - Falaich an tairgse seo','Activated' => 'Air a ghnìomhachadh','Address book' => 'Leabhar seòlaidhean','Select an image' => 'Tagh dealbh','Cart layout' => 'Cruth cairt','Cart optimizations' => 'Optimizations cairt','Enable cart page optimizations' => 'Dèan comas air optimizations duilleag cairt','Header and footer template' => 'Teamplaid header and footer','Controls whether to use the distraction free page header and footer or keep the currently active theme\'s header and footer.' => 'Smachd air am bu chòir bann-cinn is bonn-coise na duilleige gun dragh a chleachdadh no bann-cinn is bonn-coise a’ chuspair a tha gnìomhach an-dràsta a chumail.','Distraction free header and footer' => 'Header agus bonn-coise gun dragh sam bith','Theme\'s header and footer' => 'Bun-cinn is bonn a’ chuspair','Cart elements' => 'Feartan cairt','Make the order summary stay visible on the cart page while scrolling' => 'Dèan geàrr-chunntas an òrduigh ri fhaicinn air duilleag na cairt fhad ‘s a sgrìobhas tu','Coupon codes' => 'Còdan coupon','Hidden' => 'Falaichte','Before the cart items section' => 'Ron roinn stuthan cairt','Inside the cart items section' => 'Taobh a-staigh roinn stuthan cairt','After the cart items section' => 'Às deidh earrann nan nithean cairt','Before the shipping section' => 'Ron roinn luingeis','After the shipping section' => 'Às deidh an roinn luingeis','Before the order summary' => 'Mus deach an òrdugh geàrr-chunntas','Inside the order summary' => 'Taobh a-staigh an òrdugh geàrr-chunntas','Before the order totals' => 'Mus tig an òrdugh gu h-iomlan','After the order totals' => 'Às deidh an òrdugh iomlan','After the order summary' => 'Às deidh geàrr-chunntas an òrduigh','Shipping' => 'Luingearachd','Select position where to display the shipping costs and calculator on the cart page.' => 'Tagh suidheachadh far an seall thu na cosgaisean luingeis agus an àireamhair air duilleag na cairt.','Display as a cart section' => 'Taisbeanadh mar roinn cairt','Cross-sells' => 'Crois-reic','Select position where to display the cross-sells section on the cart page.' => 'Tagh suidheachadh far an seall thu an roinn tar-reic air duilleag na cairt.','Before the cart actions' => 'Ro ghnìomhan a &#39;chairt','After the cart actions' => 'Às deidh na gnìomhan cairt','Layout of cross-sell items on the cart page.' => 'Cruth de nithean tar-reic air duilleag na cairt.','Optimized horizontal cross-sells layout' => 'Cruth tar-reic còmhnard as fheàrr','Theme\'s cross-sells layout' => 'Tha cruth tar-reic a’ chuspair','Number of cross-sell items to display on the cart page' => 'An àireamh de nithean tar-reic ri thaisbeanadh air duilleag na cairt','Add widget areas to the cart page' => 'Cuir raointean widget ri duilleag na cairt','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the cart page.' => 'Tha na raointean widget seo air an cleachdadh gus samhlaidhean earbsa agus bràistean earbsa a chuir air duilleag na cairt.','Checkout' => 'Dèan sgrùdadh air','Checkout layout' => 'Cruth an t-seic','Design template' => 'Teamplaid dealbhadh','Dark mode' => 'Modh dorcha','Enable dark mode' => 'Dèan comas air modh dorcha','Logo image' => 'Dealbh suaicheantas','Choose an image to be displayed on the checkout page header. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => 'Tagh dealbh a thèid a thaisbeanadh air bann-cinn na duilleige pàighidh. Chan eil seo a’ buntainn ach nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh bann-cinn is bonn-coise gun dragh.','Header background color' => 'Dath cùl-cinn a’ chinn','Choose a background color for the checkout page header. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => 'Tagh dath cùl-fhiosrachaidh airson bann-cinn duilleag pàighidh. Chan eil seo a’ buntainn ach nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh bann-cinn is bonn-coise gun dragh.','HTML color value. ie: #f3f3f3' => 'Luach dath HTML. ie: #f3f3f3','Page background color' => 'Dath cùl na duilleige','Choose a background color for the checkout page. Color is applied to the <em>body</em> element.' => 'Tagh dath cùl-raoin airson an duilleag pàighidh. Tha dath air a chur ris an eileamaid <em>bodhaig</em> .','Footer background color' => 'Dath cùl-raoin footer','Choose a background color for the checkout page footer. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => 'Tagh dath cùl-fhiosrachaidh airson bonn-coise na duilleige pàighidh. Chan eil seo a’ buntainn ach nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh bann-cinn is bonn-coise gun dragh.','Progress bar' => 'Bàr adhartais','Display the checkout progress bar when using multi-step checkout layout' => 'Seall am bàr adhartais pàighidh nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh cruth pàighidh ioma-cheum','Make the checkout progress bar stay visible while scrolling' => 'Dèan am bàr adhartais pàighidh ri fhaicinn fhad ‘s a sgrìobhas tu','Express checkout' => 'Express checkout','Enable the express checkout section' => 'Dèan comas air an roinn pàighidh luath','Displays the express checkout section at checkout when supported payment gateways have this feature enabled.' => 'A’ taisbeanadh an roinn pàighidh luath aig àite-pàighidh nuair a bhios am feart seo air a chomasachadh le geataichean pàighidh le taic.','Display express checkout buttons in one line for larger screens' => 'Seall putanan pàighidh luath ann an aon loidhne airson scrionaichean nas motha','Ignore additional checkout required fields when paying with a compatible express checkout payment gateway' => 'Na cuir a-mach raointean pàighidh a bharrachd a tha a dhìth nuair a phàigheas tu le geata pàighidh pàighidh luath co-fhreagarrach','Make the order summary stay visible while scrolling' => 'Dèan geàrr-chunntas an òrduigh ri fhaicinn fhad ‘s a sgrìobhas tu','Choose a background color for the order summary section.' => 'Tagh dath cùl-raoin airson earrann geàrr-chunntas an òrduigh.','Highlight the order totals row in the order summary table' => 'Comharraich sreath iomlan an òrduigh anns a’ chlàr geàrr-chunntas òrduigh','Most useful when the order summary section does not have a highlighted background color. Might also apply to the Cart, Order Received and View Order pages when using Fluid Checkout PRO.' => 'Nas fheumaile nuair nach eil dath cùl-raoin comharraichte air an roinn geàrr-chunntas òrduigh. Dh’ fhaodadh e cuideachd a bhith a’ buntainn ris na duilleagan Cart, Òrdugh a fhuaireadh agus Faic Òrdugh nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh Fluid Checkout PRO.','Action link on the order summary at checkout.' => 'Ceangal gnìomh air geàrr-chunntas an òrduigh aig àite-pàighidh.','Edit cart link' => 'Deasaich ceangal cairt','Cart items count' => 'Bidh nithean cairt a’ cunntadh','Link to shop page' => 'Ceangal gu duilleag na bùtha','Cart items' => 'Feartan cairt','Hide cart items errors at the checkout page' => 'Falaich mearachdan nithean cairt aig an duilleag pàighidh','Do not display the cart items errors message at the top of the checkout page. When submitting the checkout form to complete the purchase, these error messages will always be displayed.' => 'Na seall teachdaireachd mhearachdan nithean na cairt aig mullach na duilleige pàighidh. Nuair a chuireas tu a-steach am foirm pàighidh gus an ceannach a chrìochnachadh, bidh na teachdaireachdan mearachd sin an-còmhnaidh air an taisbeanadh.','Place order' => 'Cuir òrdugh','Define the position to display "Place order" and terms checkbox section.' => 'Mìnich an suidheachadh airson “òrdugh àite” a thaisbeanadh agus teirmean earrann bogsa sgrùdaidh.','Some options might not be compatible with some plugins and themes.' => 'Is dòcha nach bi cuid de roghainnean co-chòrdail ri cuid de plugins agus cuspairean.','Below the payment section' => 'Fon roinn pàighidh','Below the order summary' => 'Gu h-ìosal tha geàrr-chunntas an òrduigh','Both below the payment section and the order summary' => 'An dà chuid fon roinn pàighidh agus geàrr-chunntas an òrduigh','Add widget areas to the checkout page' => 'Cuir raointean widget ris an duilleag pàighidh','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the checkout page.' => 'Tha na raointean widget seo air an cleachdadh gus samhlaidhean earbsa agus bràistean earbsa a chuir air an duilleag pàighidh.','Display the coupon codes section title' => 'Seall an tiotal earrann còd coupon','Select position where to display the coupon codes section on the checkout page.' => 'Tagh suidheachadh far an seall thu an roinn còdan coupon air an duilleag pàighidh.','Before the checkout steps' => 'Ro na ceumannan pàighidh','As a substep before payment methods' => 'Mar fho-cheum mus dòighean pàighidh','As a substep after payment methods' => 'Mar fho-cheum às deidh dòighean pàighidh','Default button style' => 'Stoidhle putan bunaiteach','"Add" link button' => 'Putan ceangail &quot;Cuir ris&quot;.','Checkout fields' => 'Àiteachan pàighidh','Optional fields' => 'Raointean roghainneil','Hide optional fields behind a link button' => 'Falaich raointean roghainneil air cùlaibh putan ceangail','It is recommended to keep this option checked to reduce the number of open input fields, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#1-address-line-2--company-name-can-safely-be-collapsed-behind-a-link" target="_blank">read the research</a>.' => 'Thathas a’ moladh gun cùm thu sùil air an roghainn seo gus an àireamh de raointean inntrigidh fosgailte a lughdachadh, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#1-address-line-2--company-name-can-safely-be-collapsed-behind-a-link" target="_blank">leugh an rannsachadh</a> .','Do not hide "Address line 2" fields behind a link button' => 'Na cuir am falach raointean “Seòladh loidhne 2” air cùl putan ceangail','Recommended only when most customers actually need the "Address line 2" field, or when getting the right shipping address is crucial (ie. if delivering food and other perishable products).' => 'Air a mholadh dìreach nuair a tha feum aig a’ mhòr-chuid de luchd-ceannach air an raon “Seòladh loidhne 2”, no nuair a tha e deatamach gum faigh iad an seòladh luingeis ceart (ie ma tha iad a’ lìbhrigeadh biadh agus toraidhean meatach eile).','Billing address' => 'Seòladh airson cunntas','Select position where to display the billing address section on the checkout page.' => 'Tagh suidheachadh far an seall thu an roinn seòladh bileachaidh air an duilleag pàighidh.','As a step before shipping' => 'Mar cheum mus luingearachd','As a sub-step before the shipping address section' => 'Mar fho-cheum ron roinn seòladh luingeis','As a sub-step after the shipping address section' => 'Mar fho-cheum às deidh an earrann seòladh luingeis','As a step after shipping' => 'Mar cheum an dèidh luingeis','As a sub-step before the payment section' => 'Mar fho-cheum ron roinn pàighidh','Force billing and shipping addresses to the same (single section)' => 'Feachd bilean agus seòlaidhean luingeis chun an aon rud (roinn singilte)','Checkbox for "Same as shipping/billing address" checked by default' => 'Bogsa-dearbhaidh airson “Co-ionann ri seòladh luingeis / bileachaidh” air a sgrùdadh gu bunaiteach','The checkbox "Same as shiping address" will start as checked by default when the shipping address section is displayed first. <br>The checkbox "Same as billing address" will start as checked by default when the billing address section is displayed first. <br> It is recommended to leave this option checked as to significantly reduce the number of open input fields at checkout, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#3-default-billing--shipping-and-hide-the-fields-entirely" target="_blank">read the research</a>.' => 'Tòisichidh am bogsa sgrùdaidh “An aon rud ri seòladh luingeis” mar a chaidh a dhearbhadh gu bunaiteach nuair a thèid an roinn seòladh luingeis a thaisbeanadh an toiseach.<br> Tòisichidh am bogsa sgrùdaidh “An aon rud ri seòladh bileachaidh” mar a chaidh a dhearbhadh gu bunaiteach nuair a thèid an roinn seòladh bileachaidh a thaisbeanadh an toiseach.<br> Thathas a’ moladh an roghainn seo fhàgail fo sgrùdadh gus an àireamh de raointean inntrigidh fosgailte a lughdachadh gu mòr aig àm pàighidh, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#3-default-billing--shipping-and-hide-the-fields-entirely" target="_blank">leugh an rannsachadh</a> .','Highlight the billing address section in the checkout form' => 'Thoir cuideam air an roinn seòladh bileachaidh san fhoirm pàighidh','Shipping address' => 'Seòladh luingeis','Highlight the shipping address section in the checkout form' => 'Thoir cuideam air an roinn seòladh luingeis san fhoirm pàighidh','Shipping methods' => 'Dòighean luingeis','Choose in which position to display the shipping methods section.' => 'Tagh dè an suidheachadh airson an roinn dòighean luingeis a thaisbeanadh.','Before shipping address' => 'Mus tèid an seòladh a lìbhrigeadh','After shipping address' => 'Às deidh seòladh luingeis','Local pickup' => 'Togail ionadail','Removes shipping address section when a local pickup shipping method is selected.' => 'Thoir air falbh roinn seòladh luingeis nuair a thèid dòigh luingeis togail ionadail a thaghadh.','Replaces the shipping address with the pickup point location when a local pickup shipping method is selected.' => 'Cuir àite an àite togail an àite an t-seòlaidh luingeis nuair a thèid dòigh luingeis togail ionadail a thaghadh.','Choose which address to save as the shipping address for local pickup orders.' => 'Tagh dè an seòladh airson a shàbhaladh mar an seòladh luingeis airson òrdughan togail ionadail.','Save the selected pickup location' => 'Sàbhail an t-àite togail taghte','Save same as the billing address' => 'Sàbhail an aon rud ris an t-seòladh cunntais','Do not save any shipping address' => 'Na sàbhail seòladh luingeis sam bith','Company name field for shipping address' => 'Raon ainm companaidh airson seòladh luingeis','Change visibility for the company name field for the shipping address section on the checkout form.' => 'Atharraich faicsinneachd airson raon ainm a ’chompanaidh airson an roinn seòladh luingeis air an fhoirm pàighidh.','If field is set as "optional", which is the default visibility state, no changes will be applied to let other plugins apply any changes they need.' => 'Ma tha an raon air a shuidheachadh mar “roghainneil”, is e sin an staid faicsinneachd bunaiteach, cha tèid atharrachaidhean sam bith a chuir an sàs gus leigeil le plugins eile atharrachaidhean sam bith a tha a dhìth orra a chuir an sàs.','Hidden (remove field)' => 'Falaichte (thoir air falbh an raon)','Optional' => 'Roghainneil','Required' => 'A dhìth','Add shipping phone field to the checkout form.' => 'Cuir raon fòn luingeis ris an fhoirm pàighidh.','Choose in which step to display the shipping phone field.' => 'Tagh dè an ceum gus an raon fòn luingeis a thaisbeanadh.','Contact step' => 'Ceum fios','Billing phone' => 'fòn bileachaidh','Add billing phone field to the checkout form.' => 'Cuir raon fòn bileachaidh ris an fhoirm pàighidh.','Choose in which step to display the billing phone field.' => 'Tagh dè an ceum gus an raon fòn bileachaidh a thaisbeanadh.','Show country code beside the flag' => 'Seall còd na dùthcha ri taobh na brataich','Show an example of a valid phone number inside phone fields' => 'Seall eisimpleir de àireamh fòn dligheach taobh a-staigh raointean fòn','Do not change placeholders' => 'Na atharraich luchd-àite','Show if not defined' => 'Seall mura h-eil e air a mhìneachadh','Always show' => 'Seall an-còmhnaidh','Order notes' => 'Òrdugh notaichean','Define the visibility of the additional order notes field.' => 'Mìnich faicsinneachd an raon notaichean òrdugh a bharrachd.','Gift options' => 'Roghainnean tiodhlac','Allow customers to add a gift message and other gift related options to the order.' => 'Leig le luchd-ceannach teachdaireachd tiodhlac agus roghainnean eile co-cheangailte ri tiodhlac a chur ris an òrdugh.','Display the gift message as part of the order details table instead of a separate section' => 'Seall an teachdaireachd tiodhlac mar phàirt de chlàr mion-fhiosrachadh an òrduigh an àite earrann air leth','This option affects the order confirmation page (thank you page) and order details on account pages, emails and packing slips.' => 'Bheir an roghainn seo buaidh air duilleag dearbhaidh òrduigh (duilleag taing) agus mion-fhiosrachadh òrduigh air duilleagan cunntais, puist-d agus bileagan pacaidh.','Account matching' => 'Co-fhreagairt cunntais','Enable the account matching feature' => 'Dèan comas air feart co-ionnanachd cunntais','Associate the guest customer\'s orders with their existing account when an account already exists with the customer\'s contact details.' => 'Ceangail òrdughan an neach-ceannach aoigheachd leis a’ chunntas a th’ aca mu thràth nuair a tha cunntas ann mu thràth le fiosrachadh conaltraidh an neach-ceannach.','Display message when an account exists with the email address provided' => 'Seall teachdaireachd nuair a tha cunntas ann leis an t-seòladh post-d a chaidh a thoirt seachad','Replaces the account creation fields with a notification and option to log in. In some contexts, it might be recommended to leave this option disabled to protect the privacy of customers.' => 'Cuir brath agus roghainn logadh a-steach an àite nan raointean cruthachaidh cunntais. Ann an cuid de cho-theacsan, dh’ fhaodadh gum biodh e air a mholadh an roghainn seo fhàgail ciorramach gus prìobhaideachd luchd-ceannach a dhìon.','Dashboard' => 'Deas-bhòrd','Integrations' => 'Amalachaidhean','License keys' => 'Iuchraichean ceadachais','Visit our website for more information about our plugins and add-ons.' => 'Tadhail air an làrach-lìn againn airson tuilleadh fiosrachaidh mu na plugins agus na tuilleadan againn.','Order pay page' => 'Duilleag pàighidh òrdugh','Order pay' => 'Òrdugh pàigheadh','Enable order pay page optimizations' => 'Dèan comas air òrdugh pàighidh duilleag optimizations','Changes the layout of order pay page for existing orders pending payment from the customer.' => 'Ag atharrachadh cruth duilleag pàighidh òrduigh airson òrdughan a th’ ann mar-thà a’ feitheamh ri pàigheadh bhon neach-ceannach.','Add widget areas to the order pay page' => 'Cuir raointean widget ris an duilleag pàighidh òrduigh','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the order pay page.' => 'Tha na raointean widget seo air an cleachdadh gus samhlaidhean earbsa agus bràistean earbsa a chuir air duilleag pàighidh an òrduigh.','Thank you page & order details layout' => 'Duilleag taing &amp; cruth mion-fhiosrachadh an òrduigh','Order details optimizations' => 'Òrdaich mion-fhiosrachadh optimizations','Enable thank you page and order details optimizations' => 'Dèan comas air duilleag taing agus òrduigh mion-fhiosrachadh optimizations','Changes the layout of order details on the thank you page and account pages.' => 'Ag atharrachadh cruth mion-fhiosrachadh òrduigh air an duilleag taing agus duilleagan cunntais.','Enable order details customizations on email notifications' => 'Dèan comas air gnàthachadh mion-fhiosrachadh òrduigh air brathan post-d','Display new sections and change order of sections on email notifications. Styles of order details on email notifications remain unchanged.' => 'Seall earrannan ùra agus atharraich òrdugh nan earrannan air brathan post-d. Tha stoidhlichean mion-fhiosrachadh òrduigh air brathan post-d fhathast gun atharrachadh.','Thank you page' => 'Tapadh leibh duilleag','These options affect the thank you page, also known as order received or order confirmation pages.' => 'Bheir na roghainnean sin buaidh air an duilleag taing, ris an canar cuideachd òrdugh a fhuaireadh no duilleagan dearbhaidh òrduigh.','Order details layout' => 'Òrdugh cruth mion-fhiosrachadh','Display the order details with wide layout on the thank you page' => 'Seall mion-fhiosrachadh an òrduigh le cruth farsaing air an duilleag taing','Add widget areas to the thank you page' => 'Cuir raointean widget ris an duilleag taing','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the thank you page.' => 'Tha na raointean widget seo air an cleachdadh gus samhlaidhean earbsa agus bràistean earbsa a chuir air an duilleag taing.','Order actions' => 'Òrdugh gnìomhan','Choose in which position to display the order actions.' => 'Tagh dè an suidheachadh gus na gnìomhan òrduigh a thaisbeanadh.','Inside the order overview' => 'Geàrr-chunntas taobh a-staigh òrdugh','After the order overview' => 'Às deidh geàrr-chunntas an òrduigh','After order sections' => 'Às deidh earrannan òrdugh','Order status' => 'Inbhe òrduigh','Display the order status progress bar' => 'Seall am bàr adhartais inbhe òrduigh','Choose in which position to display the section.' => 'Tagh dè an suidheachadh airson an roinn a thaisbeanadh.','After the order overview and payment instructions' => 'Às deidh ath-shealladh an òrduigh agus an stiùireadh pàighidh','Before the order items section' => 'Ro earrann nan nithean òrduigh','Inside the order items section' => 'Taobh a-staigh earrann nan stuthan òrduigh','After the order items section' => 'Às deidh earrann nan nithean òrduigh','On the sidebar' => 'Air a &#39;bhàr-taobh','Order downloads' => 'Òrdughan luchdadh a-nuas','Gift message' => 'Teachdaireachd tiodhlac','Tools' => 'Innealan','Troubleshooting' => 'Fuasgladh thrioblaidean','Debug options' => 'Roghainnean deasbaid','Debug mode' => 'Modh deasbaid','Using debug mode affects the website performance. Only use this option while troubleshooting.' => 'Bidh cleachdadh modh deasbaid a’ toirt buaidh air coileanadh na làraich-lìn. Na cleachd an roghainn seo ach fhad ‘s a tha thu a’ fuasgladh dhuilgheadasan.','Load unminified assets' => 'Luchdaich a-nuas maoin gun chlàradh','Enhanced select fields' => 'Raointean taghte leasaichte','Fix automatic zoom-in on form fields' => 'Ceartaich gluasad a-steach fèin-ghluasadach air raointean foirm','Set <code>font-size</code> inside form fields to 16px' => 'Suidhich <code>font-size</code> taobh a-staigh raointean cruth gu 16px','Fluid Checkout' => 'Checkout fluid','Settings' => 'Suidhichidhean','Support' => 'Taic','<a target="_blank" href="%s">Upgrade to PRO</a> to unlock more options.' => '<a target="_blank" href="%s">Àrdaich gu PRO</a> gus barrachd roghainnean fhuasgladh.','(PRO)' => '(PRO)','(experimental)' => '(deuchainneach)','Please verify your phone number.' => 'Feuch an dearbhaich thu an àireamh fòn agad.','The Bluehost Plugin' => 'Am plugan Bluehost','Custom fields' => 'Raointean gnàthaichte','Enable custom shipping email field' => 'Dèan comas air raon post-d àbhaisteach luingearachd','When enabled, the shipping email field from the Bluehost plugin will be added to the checkout form.' => 'Nuair a bhios e comasach, thèid an raon post-d luingeis bhon plugan Bluehost a chur ris an fhoirm pàighidh.','Captcha Pro by BestWebSoft' => 'Captcha Pro le BestWebSoft','Captcha position' => 'Suidheachadh captcha','Define the position to display the captcha section. Some positions might not work depending on the captcha type chosen.' => 'Mìnich an suidheachadh airson an earrann captcha a thaisbeanadh. Is dòcha nach obraich cuid de dhreuchdan a rèir an t-seòrsa captcha a chaidh a thaghadh.','Selecting a pickup point is required before proceeding.' => 'Feumar àite togail a thaghadh mus lean thu air adhart.','Pickup point' => 'Àite togail','Pickup point not selected yet.' => 'Chan eil puing togail air a thaghadh fhathast.','Pickup point:' => 'Àite togail:','Mailchimp for WooCommerce' => 'Mailchimp airson WooCommerce','Subscribe checkbox' => 'Subscribe box','Override the position for the subscribe checkbox on the checkout page and always display it on the contact step' => 'Cuir thairis suidheachadh a’ bhogsa sgrùdaidh ballrachd air an duilleag pàighidh agus an-còmhnaidh seall e air a’ cheum conaltraidh','Before Shipping Address' => 'Ro sheòladh Shipping','(originally "%s")' => '(&quot;%s an toiseach&quot;)','After Shipping Address' => 'Às deidh Seòladh Shipping','Selecting a collection point is required when shipping with FermoPoint.' => 'Tha feum air àite cruinneachaidh a thaghadh nuair a thathar a’ lìbhrigeadh le FermoPoint.','If checked informs typos in email to users. (This feature has been disabled because Fluid Checkout offers the feature. Changes to this option will not take effect)' => 'Ma thèid a sgrùdadh cuir fios gu typos ann am post-d gu luchd-cleachdaidh. (Chaidh am feart seo a chur à comas a chionn &#39;s gu bheil Fluid Checkout a&#39; tabhann am feart. Cha tig atharraichean air an roghainn seo gu buil)','Enable Mail Check: (disabled feature)' => 'Dèan comas air seic puist: (feart ciorramach)','Carrier:' => 'Neach-giùlain:','Sendinblue - WooCommerce Email Marketing' => 'Sendinblue - Margaidheachd post-d WooCommerce','Sign up checkbox position' => 'Clàraich suidheachadh a’ bhogsa sgrùdaidh','Move the sign up checkbox to the contact step' => 'Gluais am bogsa-dearbhaidh soidhnidh chun cheum conaltraidh','When enabled, the checkbox will be moved to the contact step independently of the display location defined in the Sendinblue plugin settings.' => 'Nuair a bhios e comasach, thèid am bogsa-dearbhaidh a ghluasad chun cheum conaltraidh gu neo-eisimeileach bhon àite taisbeanaidh a tha air a mhìneachadh ann an roghainnean plugan Sendinblue.','Theme Betheme' => 'Cuspair Betheme','Checkout progress' => 'Adhartas checkout','Output the checkout steps section from Betheme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => 'Cuir a-mach an earrann ceumannan pàighidh bho Betheme air na duilleagan pàighidh, cairt agus òrdugh a fhuaireadh.','Theme Fennik' => 'Cuspair Fennik','Breadcrumbs' => 'Briosgaidean','Output the breadcrumbs section from the Fennik theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => 'Cuir a-mach an roinn briseagan bho chuspair Fennik nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh bann-cinn is bonn-coise Fluid Checkout.','Theme Go' => 'Theme Rach','My account layout' => 'Cruth mo chunntas','Enable wide layout on "My account" page.' => 'Dèan comas air cruth farsaing air duilleag “Mo chunntas”.','Theme Impreza' => 'Cuspair Impreza','Header' => 'Ceann-cinnidh','Spacing for site header at the checkout page (in pixels)' => 'Àite airson bann-cinn na làraich aig an duilleag pàighidh (ann am piogsail)','Only applicable when using the Impreza theme header at the checkout page.' => 'Freagarrach a-mhàin nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh bann-cinn cuspair Impreza air an duilleag pàighidh.','Theme Kapee' => 'Cuspair Kapee','Output the checkout steps section from the Kapee theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => 'Cuir a-mach an roinn ceumannan pàighidh bho chuspair Kapee air na duilleagan pàighidh, cairt agus òrdugh a fhuaireadh.','Theme Porto' => 'Porto cuspair','Output the checkout steps section from the Porto theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => 'Cuir a-mach an roinn ceumannan pàighidh bho chuspair Porto air na duilleagan pàighidh, cairt agus òrdugh a fhuaireadh.','Theme Pressmart' => 'Cuspair Pressmart','Output the checkout steps section from the Pressmart theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => 'Cuir a-mach an roinn ceumannan pàighidh bhon chuspair Pressmart air na duilleagan pàighidh, cairt agus òrdugh a fhuaireadh.','Theme The Gem' => 'Cuspair The Gem','Output the checkout steps section from The Gem theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => 'Cuir a-mach an roinn ceumannan pàighidh bho chuspair The Gem nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh bann-cinn is bonn-coise Fluid Checkout.','Theme Woodmart' => 'Cuspair Woodmart','Output the checkout steps section from the Woodmart theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => 'Cuir a-mach an earrann ceumannan pàighidh bho chuspair Woodmart nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh bann-cinn is bonn-coise Fluid Checkout.','Checkout options' => 'Roghainnean pàighidh','Disable the theme checkout options' => 'Cuir à comas roghainnean pàighidh cuspair','The options display product image, quantity field, remove button and link to product page added by the theme are disabled by default.' => 'Tha na roghainnean a’ taisbeanadh ìomhaigh toraidh, raon meud, putan thoir air falbh agus ceangal gu duilleag toraidh a chuir an cuspair ris a chiorramachadh gu bunaiteach.','Theme Atomion' => 'Atomion cuspair','Order progress' => 'Òrdugh adhartas','Display order progress from the theme' => 'Seall adhartas òrdugh bhon chuspair','Display the form field labels visible on the page' => 'Seall na leubail raon foirm a chithear air an duilleag','It is recommended to keep this option enabled for a better user experience.' => 'Thathas a’ moladh an roghainn seo a chumail comasach airson eòlas cleachdaiche nas fheàrr.','Theme ZK Nito' => 'Cuspair ZK Nito saor an asgaidh','Add extra fields to the checkout form' => 'Cuir raointean a bharrachd ris an fhoirm pàighidh','Adds an extra shipping email and shipping phone field to the shipping address section.' => 'Cuir post-d luingeis a bharrachd agus raon fòn luingeis ris an roinn seòladh luingeis.','Go to the home page' => 'Rach dhan duilleag-dhachaigh','Skip to content' => 'Rach gu susbaint','Create an account' => 'Cruthaich cunntas','Log in to your account' => 'Log a-steach don chunntas agad','Already have an account?' => 'A bheil cunntas agad mu thràth?','Logged in as %1$s. <a href="%2$s">Log out</a>' => 'Air logadh a-steach mar %1$s. <a href="%2$s">Log a-mach</a>','Your order has a total amount due of %s. No further payment is needed.' => 'Tha suim iomlan de %s aig an òrdugh agad ri phàigheadh. Chan eil feum air tuilleadh pàighidh.','Close and continue with checkout' => 'Dùin agus lean air adhart leis an àite-pàighidh','Continue' => 'Lean air adhart','Parcel terminal' => 'Terminal parsailean','<p>This widget has been replaced by Fluid Checkout. </p><p>When using Fluid Checkout, the checkout page needs to use the original WooCommerce shortcode <code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code> to work properly.</p><p>For more information, visit the Fluid Checkout documentation.</p>' => '<p>Chaidh Fluid Checkout a chuir na àite a’ widget seo.</p><p> Nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh Fluid Checkout, feumaidh an duilleag pàighidh an shortcode tùsail WooCommerce <code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code> a chleachdadh gus obrachadh gu ceart.</p><p> Airson tuilleadh fiosrachaidh, tadhal air an Fluid Checkout sgrìobhainnean.</p>','Theme The7' => 'Cuspair The7','Additional header sections' => 'Earrannan cinn a bharrachd','Output additional header sections if enabled in the theme settings.' => 'Cuir a-mach earrannan cinn a bharrachd ma tha sin air a chomasachadh ann an roghainnean a’ chuspair.','More information' => 'Tuilleadh fiosrachaidh','Pick a Locker' => 'Tagh Locker','Page template' => 'Teamplaid duilleag','Use `Order confirmation` page template for block-based themes' => 'Cleachd teamplaid duilleag ‘Dearbhadh òrduigh’ airson cuspairean stèidhichte air blocaichean','Only applies when using a block-based theme.' => 'Chan eil seo a’ buntainn ach nuair a thathar a’ cleachdadh cuspair stèidhichte air blocaichean.','WooCommerce Stripe Gateway' => 'Geata Stripe WooCommerce','Payment form' => 'Foirm pàighidh','Apply styles to the Stripe payment form fields' => 'Cuir stoidhlichean an sàs ann an raointean foirm pàighidh Stripe','When enabled, Fluid Checkout will apply styles optimized for compatibility with the plugin. You may want to disable this if you are using custom styles for the Stripe payment form fields.' => 'Nuair a bhios e air a chomasachadh, cuiridh Fluid Checkout stoidhlichean an sàs a tha air an leasachadh airson co-chòrdalachd leis a’ plugan. Is dòcha gum bi thu airson seo a dhì-chomasachadh ma tha thu a’ cleachdadh stoidhlichean gnàthaichte airson raointean foirm pàighidh Stripe.','Theme Nyture' => 'Cuspair Nyture','Output the checkout steps section from the Nyture theme when using Fluid Checkout.' => 'Cuir a-mach an earrann ceumannan pàighidh bhon chuspair Nyture nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh Fluid Checkout.','Allows customers to make payments for orders that are either created manually by the store admin or not completed during checkout.' => 'Leigidh seo le luchd-ceannach pàighidhean a dhèanamh airson òrdughan a chaidh a chruthachadh le làimh le rianaire a’ bhùtha no nach deach a chrìochnachadh aig àm an pàighidh.','The plugin WooCommerce Checkout Manager by Quadlayers is not compatible with Fluid Checkout' => 'Chan eil am plugan WooCommerce Checkout Manager le Quadlayers co-chòrdail ri Fluid Checkout','Company name field for billing address' => 'Raon ainm companaidh airson seòladh bileachaidh','Change visibility for the company name field for the billing address section on the checkout form.' => 'Atharraich faicsinneachd airson raon ainm a’ chompanaidh airson earrann seòlaidh bileachaidh air foirm an àite-pàighidh.','Theme Bookshelf' => 'Sgeilp Leabhraichean Cuspair','Output the checkout steps section from the Bookshelf theme when using Fluid Checkout.' => 'Cuir a-mach an earrann ceumannan pàighidh bhon chuspair Leabhraichean nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh Fluid Checkout.','Account password' => 'Facal-faire a’ chunntais','An account will be created with the information provided at checkout when completing the order.' => 'Thèid cunntas a chruthachadh leis an fhiosrachadh a chaidh a thoirt seachad aig an àite-pàighidh nuair a bhios an t-òrdugh deiseil.','Choose the style of the progress bar.' => 'Tagh stoidhle a’ bhàr adhartais.','Bars' => 'Bàraichean','Theme Ireca' => 'Cuspair Ireca','WooCommerce page layout' => 'Cruth duilleag WooCommerce','Force wide layout on WooCommerce pages' => 'Feachd cruth farsaing air duilleagan WooCommerce','This ensures the content section is not too narrow on WooCommerce pages including checkout, cart, order received, order pay and account pages.' => 'Nì seo cinnteach nach bi an earrann susbaint ro chumhang air duilleagan WooCommerce a’ gabhail a-steach duilleagan pàighidh, cairt, òrdugh a fhuaireadh, òrdugh a phàigheadh agus cunntas.','WooCommerce Smart Coupons' => 'Cùpain WooCommerce Smart','Position on checkout page' => 'Suidheachadh air duilleag an pàighidh','Choose where to display the available coupons section on the checkout page.' => 'Tagh càite an nochd thu an earrann cùpain a tha rim faighinn air duilleag an pàighidh.','Before the progress bar' => 'Roimh am bàr adhartais','After the progress bar' => 'Às dèidh a’ bhàr adhartais','Before coupon codes section' => 'Roimhe earrann nan còdan cùpain','Format phone numbers according to the rules for each country.' => 'Cuir cruth air àireamhan fòn a rèir nan riaghailtean airson gach dùthaich.','Use precise phone number validation' => 'Cleachd dearbhadh àireamh fòn mionaideach','This is an experimental feature and may not work as expected in all setups. Use it with caution.' => 'Is e feart deuchainneach a tha seo agus is dòcha nach obraich e mar a bhiodh dùil anns a h-uile suidheachadh. Cleachd e gu faiceallach.','Phone number validation types used when precise validation is enabled.' => 'Seòrsaichean dearbhaidh àireamh fòn a thathar a’ cleachdadh nuair a bhios dearbhadh mionaideach air a chomasachadh.','Mobile' => 'Fòn-làimhe','Fixed line' => 'Loidhne stèidhichte','Toll free' => 'Saor-chìs','Or' => 'No','Contact' => 'Cuir fios','Multi step' => 'Ioma-cheum','2 columns' => '2 cholbh','1 column' => '1 colbh','Before checkout steps' => 'Ceumannan mus tèid pàigheadh','When using the <em>"1 column"</em> checkout layout this option is always set to <em>"Before checkout steps"</em> and also applies to desktop view.' => 'Nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh cruth an àite-pàighidh <em>“1 colbh”,</em> bidh an roghainn seo an-còmhnaidh air a shuidheachadh gu <em>“Ceumannan mus tèid an t-àite-pàighidh a dhèanamh”</em> agus tha e cuideachd a’ buntainn ris an t-sealladh deasg.','Position for the extra order summary section on mobile.' => 'Suidheachadh airson earrann geàrr-chunntas òrdughan a bharrachd air fòn-làimhe.','The option <em>"On the site header"</em> only applies when using the distraction-free header.' => 'Chan eil an roghainn <em>&quot;Air ceann na làraich&quot;</em> a&#39; buntainn ach nuair a thathar a&#39; cleachdadh a&#39; cheann gun dragh.','On the site header (requires distraction-free header)' => 'Ceann-sgrìobhaidh air an làrach (feumaidh ceann-sgrìobhaidh gun dragh a bhith ann)','Initial state for the expansible order summary section on mobile.' => 'Staid tòiseachaidh airson earrann geàrr-chunntas òrdughan a ghabhas leudachadh air fòn-làimhe.','We recommend setting it as <em>expanded</em> for the following countries due to regulatory requirements: <strong>Germany</strong>, <strong>Austria</strong>, <strong>Switzerland</strong>, <strong>Netherlands</strong>, <strong>Poland</strong>, <strong>Belgium</strong> and <strong>France</strong>.' => 'Tha sinn a’ moladh a shuidheachadh mar <em>leudaichte</em> airson nan dùthchannan a leanas air sgàth riatanasan riaghlaidh: <strong>A’ Ghearmailt</strong> , <strong>an Ostair</strong> , <strong>an Eilbheis</strong> , <strong>na Tìrean Ìsle</strong> , <strong>a’ Phòlainn</strong> , <strong>a’ Bheilg</strong> agus <strong>an Fhraing</strong> .','Collapsed' => 'Air a thuit','Expanded' => 'Leudaichte','Do not show' => 'Na seall','yes' => 'Tha','The shipping phone field may be forced as "required" if the billing address section is displayed after the shipping address section, and the billing phone field is set as "required". This is needed to ensure the shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout form.' => 'Dh’fhaodadh gum bi an raon fòn lìbhrigidh air a shuidheachadh mar “riatanach” ma thèid earrann an t-seòlaidh bileachaidh a thaisbeanadh às dèidh earrann an t-seòlaidh lìbhrigidh, agus ma tha an raon fòn bileachaidh air a shuidheachadh mar “riatanach”. Tha seo riatanach gus dèanamh cinnteach gun gabh an seòladh lìbhrigidh a chopaigeadh chun t-seòlaidh bileachaidh nuair a thèid an roghainn sin a chomharrachadh, air neo is dòcha nach bi e comasach don neach-ceannach am foirm pàighidh a chrìochnachadh.','The billing phone field may be forced as "required" if the billing address section is displayed before the shipping address section, and the shipping phone field is set as "required". This is needed to ensure the shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout form.' => 'Dh’fhaodadh gum bi an raon fòn bileachaidh air a shuidheachadh mar “riatanach” ma thèid an earrann seòlaidh bileachaidh a thaisbeanadh ron earrann seòlaidh luingeis, agus ma tha an raon fòn luingeis air a shuidheachadh mar “riatanach”. Tha seo riatanach gus dèanamh cinnteach gun gabh an seòladh luingeis a chopaigeadh chun t-seòlaidh bileachaidh nuair a thèid an roghainn sin a chomharrachadh, air neo is dòcha nach bi e comasach don neach-ceannach am foirm pàighidh a chrìochnachadh.','Settings profiles' => 'Pròifilean roghainnean','Settings profile' => 'Pròifil roghainnean','You do not have permission to perform this action.' => 'Chan eil cead agad an gnìomh seo a dhèanamh.','You do not have permission to activate plugins.' => 'Chan eil cead agad plugain a ghnìomhachadh.','Missing plugin.' => 'Plugan a dhìth.','Plugin activated.' => 'Plugin air a ghnìomhachadh.','The following changes will be applied:' => 'Thèid na h-atharrachaidhean a leanas a chur an sàs:','Since Fluid Checkout 5.0, settings are saved differently. Legacy options are still stored in the database to allow downgrades to previous versions if needed.' => 'Bho Fluid Checkout 5.0, tha roghainnean air an sàbhaladh ann an dòigh eadar-dhealaichte. Tha roghainnean dìleab fhathast air an stòradh san stòr-dàta gus leigeil le ìsleachadh gu dreachan roimhe ma tha feum air.','Your store has been running for about 2 weeks on the new settings so you could clean up legacy options stored in the database. Please note that after cleanup, if you need to downgrade to previous versions of the plugin it will use default values for all settings.' => 'Tha an stòr agad air a bhith ag obair airson timcheall air dà sheachdain air na roghainnean ùra agus mar sin dh’ fhaodadh tu roghainnean dìleab a tha air an stòradh san stòr-dàta a ghlanadh. Thoir an aire, às dèidh glanadh, ma dh’ fheumas tu ìsleachadh gu dreachan roimhe den plugan, gun cleachd e luachan bunaiteach airson a h-uile suidheachadh.','Fluid Checkout settings cleanup' => 'Glanadh roghainnean Fluid Checkout','Delete leftover options' => 'Sguab às na roghainnean a tha air fhàgail','Help us improve Fluid Checkout' => 'Cuidich sinn le bhith a’ leasachadh Fluid Checkout','Share anonymous site environment reports with Fluid Checkout to get faster support and help us improve compatibility and measure impact. No customer, user, or sensitive data are included. You can choose what is shared anytime from the Tools settings.' => 'Roinn aithisgean àrainneachd làraich gun urra le Fluid Checkout gus taic nas luaithe fhaighinn agus gus ar cuideachadh le bhith a’ leasachadh co-chòrdalachd agus a’ tomhas buaidh. Chan eil dàta luchd-ceannach, cleachdaiche no dàta mothachail air an toirt a-steach. Faodaidh tu taghadh dè a thèid a cho-roinn aig àm sam bith bho na roghainnean Innealan.','Enable site environment reports' => 'Cuir aithisgean àrainneachd làraich an gnìomh','Review settings' => 'Roghainnean ath-sgrùdaidh','This preview has expired. Reload the admin page to start a new preview.' => 'Tha an ro-shealladh seo air tighinn gu crìch. Ath-luchdaich duilleag an rianaire gus ro-shealladh ùr a thòiseachadh.','Preview expired' => 'Ro-shealladh air tighinn gu crìch','Orders cannot be placed in the preview.' => 'Chan urrainnear òrdughan a chur san ro-shealladh.','Logging in is not available in the preview.' => 'Chan eil logadh a-steach ri fhaighinn san ro-shealladh.','Accounts cannot be created in the preview.' => 'Chan urrainnear cunntasan a chruthachadh san ro-shealladh.','Requests to other sites are blocked in the preview.' => 'Tha iarrtasan gu làraichean eile air am bacadh san ro-shealladh.','Processing…' => 'A’ giullachd…','Something went wrong. Please try again.' => 'Chaidh rudeigin ceàrr. Feuch ris a-rithist.','Activate plugin' => 'Cuir am plugan an gnìomh','Fluid Checkout PRO - The complete checkout package' => 'Fluid Checkout PRO - Am pasgan iomlan airson pàigheadh','All PRO features + all add-ons, one price. Design templates, optimized cart and order received pages, account matching, and much more.' => 'A h-uile feart PRO + a h-uile rud a bharrachd, aon phrìs. Teamplaidean dealbhaidh, duilleagan cairt is òrdughan a fhuaireadh air an leasachadh, maidseadh cunntais, agus mòran a bharrachd.','Optimized order pay page' => 'Duilleag pàighidh òrdughan air a leasachadh','Express checkout buttons from supported payment methods' => 'Putanan pàighidh luath bho dhòighean pàighidh le taic','Delayed account creation' => 'Cruthachadh cunntais air a chur dheth','Address autocomplete with Google Maps APIs' => 'Lìonadh fèin-ghluasadach seòlaidh le APIan Google Maps','Multiple saved addresses with the address book' => 'Iomadh seòladh a chaidh a shàbhaladh leis an leabhar seòlaidhean','EU-VAT assistant' => 'Neach-cuideachaidh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte an EU','Hide this section' => 'Falaich an earrann seo','Learn more' => 'Ionnsaich barrachd','Get early access' => 'Faigh cothrom tràth','Activate add-on' => 'Cuir an tuilleadan an gnìomh','Get more out of your checkout journey' => 'Faigh barrachd a-mach às an turas pàighidh agad','Test API key' => 'Iuchair API deuchainn','Guided setup' => 'Suidheachadh treòraichte','Options' => 'Roghainnean','Set up layout and design on the <a href="%s">checkout options</a>.' => 'Suidhich cruth agus dealbhadh air na <a href="%s">roghainnean pàighidh</a> .','Enable guest checkout and/or review <a href="%s">customer accounts settings</a>.' => 'Cuir comas air pàigheadh aoighean agus/no dèan ath-sgrùdadh <a href="%s">air roghainnean cunntasan luchd-ceannach</a> .','Enable optimized <a href="%1$s">cart</a>, <a href="%2$s">thank you</a> and <a href="%3$s">order pay</a> pages.' => 'Cuir an comas duilleagan <a href="%1$s">cairt</a> , <a href="%2$s">taing</a> agus <a href="%3$s">pàighidh òrduigh</a> leasaichte.','Enable <a href="%s">address autocomplete</a> from Google Maps.' => 'Cuir comas air <a href="%s">fèin-choileanadh seòlaidh</a> bho Google Maps.','Enable multiple saved addresses with <a href="%s">address book</a>.' => 'Cuir iomadh seòladh air dòigh a shàbhaileas tu leis <a href="%s">an leabhar seòlaidhean</a> .','Check if there are any <a href="%s">integration options</a> available for the theme or other plugins you have installed.' => 'Thoir sùil a bheil <a href="%s">roghainnean amalachaidh</a> sam bith rim faighinn airson an cuspair no plugins eile a stàlaich thu.','Get faster support and help us improve compatibility and measure impact. <a href="%s">Enable usage tracking</a> from the tools settings.' => 'Faigh taic nas luaithe agus cuidich sinn le bhith a’ leasachadh co-chòrdalachd agus a’ tomhas buaidh. <a href="%s">Cuir an comas tracadh cleachdaidh</a> bho roghainnean nan innealan.','Missing settings tab.' => 'Taba roghainnean a dhìth.','Getting started' => 'A’ tòiseachadh','<strong>Great! Your checkout page is now running on Fluid Checkout.</strong> Here are a few steps to get started:' => '<strong>Sgoinneil! Tha an duilleag pàighidh agad a-nis a’ ruith air Fluid Checkout.</strong> Seo beagan cheumannan gus tòiseachadh:','Completed' => 'Crìochnaichte','Preview report data' => 'Ro-shealladh dàta na h-aithisg','Send now' => 'Cuir a-nis','Auto-detect' => 'Lorg-fèin-ghluasadach','Afrikaans' => 'Afrikaanach','Albanian' => 'Albànianach','Amharic' => 'Amharic','Arabic' => 'Arabach','Armenian' => 'Armenianach','Azerbaijani' => 'Asarbaiseànaich','Basque' => 'Basgach','Belarusian' => 'Belarusianach','Bengali' => 'Bengàlach','Bosnian' => 'Bosnianach','Bulgarian' => 'Bulgàrianach','Burmese' => 'Burmese','Catalan' => 'Catalanach','Chinese' => 'Sìneach','Chinese (Simplified)' => 'Sìonais (Sìmplichte)','Chinese (Hong Kong)' => 'Sìonais (Hong Kong)','Chinese (Traditional)' => 'Sìonais (Traidiseanta)','Croatian' => 'Croatianach','Czech' => 'Seacach','Danish' => 'Dànach','Dutch' => 'Duitseach','English' => 'Sasannach','English (Australian)' => 'Beurla (Astràilianach)','English (Great Britain)' => 'Beurla (Breatainn Mhòr)','Estonian' => 'Estòinianach','Farsi' => 'Farsi','Finnish' => 'Fionnlaineach','Filipino' => 'Filipino','French' => 'Frangach','French (Canadian)' => 'Fraingis (Canada)','Galician' => 'Galicianach','Georgian' => 'Georgianach','German' => 'Gearmailteach','Greek' => 'Grèigeach','Gujarati' => 'Gujarati','Hebrew' => 'Eabhrach','Hindi' => 'Indeach','Hungarian' => 'Hungàrianach','Icelandic' => 'Innis Tìleach','Indonesian' => 'And-Innseach','Italian' => 'Eadailteach','Japanese' => 'Iapanach','Kannada' => 'Kannada','Kazakh' => 'Kasakh','Khmer' => 'Chmer','Korean' => 'Corèanach','Kyrgyz' => 'Kyrgyz','Lao' => 'Lao','Latvian' => 'Latbhianach','Lithuanian' => 'Lithuanianach','Macedonian' => 'Macedonianach','Malay' => 'Malaidheach','Malayalam' => 'Malayalamach','Marathi' => 'Marathiach','Mongolian' => 'Mongolianach','Nepali' => 'Nepalach','Norwegian' => 'Lochlannach','Polish' => 'Pòlainneach','Portuguese' => 'Portugalach','Portuguese (Brazil)' => 'Portagailis (Braisil)','Portuguese (Portugal)' => 'Portagailis (A&#39; Phortagail)','Punjabi' => 'Punjabi','Romanian' => 'Romànianach','Russian' => 'Ruiseanach','Serbian' => 'Serbianach','Sinhalese' => 'Sinhalach','Slovak' => 'Slovacanach','Slovenian' => 'Slobhenianach','Spanish' => 'Spàinneach','Spanish (Latin America)' => 'Spàinntis (Ameireaga Laidinn)','Swahili' => 'Swahilieach','Swedish' => 'Suaineach','Tamil' => 'Tamileach','Telugu' => 'Telugach','Thai' => 'Thaidheach','Turkish' => 'Turcach','Ukrainian' => 'Ucràineach','Urdu' => 'Urdu','Vietnamese' => 'Bhiet-Namach','Zulu' => 'Zulu','Google address autocomplete' => 'Lìonadh fèin-ghluasadach seòlaidh Google','Google Places API version' => 'Tionndadh API Google Places','Choose which version of the Google Places API to use. We recommend moving to the new Places API as soon as possible.' => 'Tagh dè an dreach de Google Places API a chleachdas tu. Tha sinn a’ moladh gluasad chun an Places API ùr cho luath ‘s a ghabhas.','We recommend using "Places API (New)" as effective March 1, 2025, Google will move the "Places API (Legacy)" version into Legacy status, meaning you will no longer be able to enable this service for new API keys and that that version of the API will eventually not be available anymore. Existing accounts already using the Legacy API may continue to work without disruptions.' => 'Tha sinn a’ moladh “Places API (Ùr)” a chleachdadh oir bho 1 Màrt 2025, gluaisidh Google an dreach “Places API (Dìleab)” gu inbhe Dìleab, a’ ciallachadh nach bi e comasach dhut an t-seirbheis seo a chomasachadh tuilleadh airson iuchraichean API ùra agus nach bi an dreach sin den API ri fhaighinn tuilleadh mu dheireadh. Faodaidh cunntasan a th’ ann mar-thà a’ cleachdadh an Dìleab API leantainn air adhart ag obair gun bhriseadh sam bith.','(Recommended)' => '(Air a mholadh)','Google API key' => 'Iuchair API Google','Paste your Google API key and use the test button to confirm it works for this website. Make sure the key is valid and allowed for your domain, otherwise the address field might get blocked preventing customers from completing their orders.' => 'Cuir a-steach an iuchair Google API agad agus cleachd am putan deuchainn gus dearbhadh gu bheil e ag obair airson na làraich-lìn seo. Dèan cinnteach gu bheil an iuchair dligheach agus ceadaichte airson an àrainn agad, air neo dh’ fhaodadh an raon seòlaidh a bhith air a bhacadh a’ cur casg air luchd-ceannach bho bhith a’ crìochnachadh an òrdughan.','Enable Google address autocomplete' => 'Cuir comas air crìochnachadh fèin-ghluasadach seòlaidh Google','Enable address autocompletion using the Google Maps APIs.' => 'Cuir an comas fèin-chrìochnachadh seòlaidh le bhith a’ cleachdadh APIan Google Maps.','Google API language' => 'Cànan API Google','This language will be used to display the Google Places API address suggestions and addresses will also be autocompleted in this language.' => 'Thèid a’ chànan seo a chleachdadh gus molaidhean seòlaidh API Google Places a thaisbeanadh agus thèid seòlaidhean a chrìochnachadh gu fèin-ghluasadach sa chànan seo cuideachd.','Result types' => 'Seòrsachan thoraidhean','Leave empty to accept any type of results, which usually yields better matching results. <a href="%s" target="_blank">See documentation for more details</a>. <br>Select up to 5 types of address search results to return on address autocomplete fields. <br>Visit the Google Maps documentation to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => 'Fàg bàn gus gabhail ri seòrsa sam bith de thoraidhean, a bhios mar as trice a’ toirt a-mach toraidhean a tha nas fheàrr a rèir a’ mhaidseadh. <a href="%s" target="_blank">Faic an sgrìobhainneachd airson tuilleadh fiosrachaidh</a> .<br> Tagh suas ri 5 seòrsaichean de thoraidhean rannsachaidh seòlaidh airson tilleadh air raointean fèin-chrìochnachaidh seòlaidh.<br> Tadhail air sgrìobhainnean Google Maps gus tuilleadh ionnsachadh mu na <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">seòrsaichean a tha a’ faighinn taic</a> .','Result types (Legacy API)' => 'Seòrsachan thoraidhean (API Dìleab)','Which type of address search results to return when using Places API (Legacy). <br>Visit the documentation of the Legacy Google Places API to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/supported_types#table3" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => 'Dè an seòrsa toraidhean rannsachaidh seòlaidh a thèid a thilleadh nuair a thathar a’ cleachdadh API Àiteachan (Dìleab).<br> Tadhail air sgrìobhainnean an Legacy Google Places API gus tuilleadh ionnsachadh mu na <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/supported_types#table3" target="_blank">seòrsaichean a tha a’ faighinn taic</a> .','Company fields' => 'Raointean companaidh','Enable autocomplete for the company name if available' => 'Cuir comas air fèin-chrìochnachadh airson ainm a’ chompanaidh ma tha sin ri fhaighinn','Enable autocompletion of the company field with the company name information when returned from the Google Maps APIs.' => 'Cuir comas air fèin-chrìochnachadh achaidh a’ chompanaidh leis an fhiosrachadh ainm companaidh nuair a thèid a thilleadh bho APIan Google Maps.','Business search' => 'Lorg gnìomhachais','Enable search for businesses in the company field' => 'Cuir comas air rannsachadh airson ghnìomhachasan ann an raon a’ chompanaidh','Enable suggestion of addresses associated with a business when typing in the company field, then autocomplete all addresses fields when a business is selected from the suggestions.' => 'Cuir an comas moladh airson seòlaidhean co-cheangailte ri gnìomhachas nuair a bhios tu a’ taipeadh ann an raon a’ chompanaidh, agus an uairsin lìon a h-uile raon seòlaidh gu fèin-ghluasadach nuair a thèid gnìomhachas a thaghadh bho na molaidhean.','Company result types' => 'Seòrsachan toraidhean companaidh','Select up to 5 types of address search results to return on autocomplete company fields. <br>Recommended value is <code>establishment</code>, which includes most types of businesses. <br>Leave empty to accept any type of results, including results that are not related to businesses. <br>Visit the Google Maps documentation to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => 'Tagh suas ri 5 seòrsaichean de thoraidhean rannsachaidh seòlaidh airson tilleadh air raointean companaidh a chaidh a chrìochnachadh gu fèin-ghluasadach.<br> Is e <code>establishment</code> an luach a thathar a’ moladh, a tha a’ gabhail a-steach a’ mhòr-chuid de sheòrsaichean ghnìomhachasan.<br> Fàg bàn gus gabhail ri seòrsa sam bith de thoraidhean, a’ gabhail a-steach toraidhean nach eil co-cheangailte ri gnìomhachasan.<br> Tadhail air sgrìobhainnean Google Maps gus tuilleadh ionnsachadh mu na <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">seòrsaichean a tha a’ faighinn taic</a> .','Google logo' => 'Suaicheantas Google','Show text and logo "Powered by Google"' => 'Seall teacsa agus suaicheantas &quot;Cumhachd le Google&quot;','When checked, the text and logo "Powered by Google" will be displayed at the bottom of the address autocomplete suggestions box.' => 'Nuair a thèid a chomharrachadh, thèid an teacsa agus an suaicheantas &quot;Powered by Google&quot; a thaisbeanadh aig bonn bogsa nam molaidhean airson seòlaidhean a chrìochnachadh gu fèin-ghluasadach.','Brasil API address autocomplete' => 'Fèin-chrìochnachadh seòlaidh API Brasil','Brasil API' => 'API Bhraisil','Enable Brasil API address autocomplete for CEP fields' => 'Cuir comas fèin-choileanadh seòlaidh Brasil API airson raointean CEP','Use Brasil API to retrieve and autofill addresses using the CEP/Postcode field. Only relevant for Brazilian addresses.' => 'Cleachd Brasil API gus seòlaidhean fhaighinn air ais agus a lìonadh gu fèin-ghluasadach a’ cleachdadh an raoin CEP/Còd-puist. Iomchaidh do sheòlaidhean à Brasil a-mhàin.','API version' => 'Tionndadh API','Choose which version of the Brasil API CEP method to use.' => 'Tagh dè an dreach den mhodh CEP aig API Brasil a chleachdas tu.','Address book migration' => 'Imrich leabhar seòlaidhean','WooCommerce addresses' => 'Seòlaidhean WooCommerce','Copy existing shipping and billing addresses from WooCommerce into the customers\' address book.' => 'Dèan lethbhreac de sheòlaidhean lìbhrigidh is bileachaidh a tha ann mar-thà bho WooCommerce a-steach do leabhar seòlaidhean luchd-ceannach.','Enable the address book feature' => 'Cuir feart an leabhair seòlaidh an gnìomh','Allow customers to save multiple addresses and define the default address to be used for shipping and billing.' => 'Leig le luchd-ceannach iomadh seòladh a shàbhaladh agus an seòladh bunaiteach a mhìneachadh a thèid a chleachdadh airson luingearachd agus bileachadh.','Address labels' => 'Leubail seòlaidh','Allow customers to add a custom label for each address' => 'Leig le luchd-ceannach leubail gnàthaichte a chur ris airson gach seòladh','Address labels make it easier to for customers to distinguish between their saved addresses (ie.: "Mom\'s House"). The address labels are private to the customers, and will not be displayed or printed on the order details page or invoices.' => 'Bidh bileagan seòlaidh ga dhèanamh nas fhasa do luchd-ceannach eadar-dhealachadh a dhèanamh eadar na seòlaidhean a shàbhail iad (m.e.: &quot;Taigh Màthar&quot;). Tha na bileagan seòlaidh prìobhaideach do luchd-ceannach, agus cha tèid an taisbeanadh no an clò-bhualadh air duilleag mion-fhiosrachaidh an òrduigh no air na cunntasan.','Display layout' => 'Cruth taisbeanaidh','Choose how saved addresses are displayed at checkout and on the cart.' => 'Tagh mar a thèid seòlaidhean a chaidh a shàbhaladh a thaisbeanadh aig an àite-pàighidh agus air a’ chairt.','Applies at checkout and on the cart. Saved addresses on the account page always use the cards layout.' => 'A’ buntainn aig an àite-pàighidh agus air a’ chairt. Bidh seòlaidhean a chaidh a shàbhaladh air duilleag a’ chunntais an-còmhnaidh a’ cleachdadh cruth nan cairtean.','Address cards' => 'Cairtean seòlaidh','Address list' => 'Liosta seòlaidhean','Dropdown field' => 'Raon tuiteam-sìos','Address search' => 'Lorg seòlaidh','Show address search filter on frontend when customer has at least this number of saved addresses available.' => 'Seall criathrag rannsachaidh seòlaidhean air an aghaidh nuair a bhios co-dhiù an àireamh seo de sheòlaidhean sàbhalaidh rim faighinn aig an neach-ceannach.','Not used when display layout is set to dropdown field.' => 'Cha tèid a chleachdadh nuair a tha cruth an taisbeanaidh air a shuidheachadh gu raon tuiteam-sìos.','Addresses' => 'Seòlaidhean','Enable cart page optimizations to see more options' => 'Cuir comas air leasachadh duilleag a’ chairt gus barrachd roghainnean fhaicinn','Sticky order summary' => 'Geàrr-chunntas òrdugh steigeach','Select position where to display the coupon codes section on the cart page. Only applicable when AJAX cart is enabled, and if use of coupon codes are enabled in the WooCommerce settings.' => 'Tagh an t-àite far am bu chòir earrann nan còdan cùpain a thaisbeanadh air duilleag a’ chairt. Chan eil seo iomchaidh ach nuair a tha cairt AJAX air a chomasachadh, agus ma tha cleachdadh chòdan cùpain air a chomasachadh anns na roghainnean WooCommerce.','Layout of cross-sell' => 'Cruth-cruinneachaidh reic thar-roinneil','Cross-sells displayed' => 'Tar-reic air an taisbeanadh','Items' => 'Nithean','Cart page optimization' => 'Leasachadh duilleag a’ chairt','Give your cart the same clear, conversion-focused layout as your checkout.' => 'Thoir an aon chruth soilleir, stèidhichte air tionndadh, don chairt agad ’s a tha aig an àite-pàighidh agad.','Match the cart layout to the checkout page for a consistent purchase journey.' => 'Maidseadh cruth a’ chairt ris an duilleag pàighidh airson turas ceannach cunbhalach.','Keep the cart always updated in the background, no full page reloads when quantities change.' => 'Cùm a’ chairt ùraichte an-còmhnaidh air a’ chùlaibh, gun ath-luchdachadh làn-dhuilleag nuair a dh’atharraicheas meudan.','Place coupon codes, shipping, and cross-sells exactly where they convert best.' => 'Cuir còdan cùpain, luingearachd, agus tar-reic dìreach far a bheil iad ag atharrachadh as fheàrr.','Keep the order summary visible while scrolling, and add trust symbols where shoppers need reassurance.' => 'Cùm geàrr-chunntas an òrduigh ri fhaicinn fhad ’s a tha thu a’ sgroladh, agus cuir samhlaidhean earbsa ris far a bheil feum aig luchd-ceannach air misneachd.','Columns' => 'Colbhan','General styles for the checkout steps, order summary and other sections. Applies to other checkout, cart, thank you (order received), and view order pages.' => 'Stoidhlichean coitcheann airson ceumannan an àite-pàighidh, geàrr-chunntas an òrduigh agus earrannan eile. A’ buntainn ri duilleagan eile airson an àite-pàighidh, a’ chairt, taing (òrdugh air fhaighinn), agus an òrdugh fhaicinn.','When using the <em>"1 column"</em> layout with the <em>"Split"</em> design template, a right column is shown only if the page sidebar widget area is active (Checkout Sidebar, Cart Sidebar, or Order Received Sidebar). Otherwise the page stays as a single column with Split styles.' => 'Nuair a bhios tu a’ cleachdadh an cruth <em>“1 cholbh”</em> leis an teamplaid dealbhaidh <em>“Roinnt”</em> , chan fhaicear colbh deas ach ma tha raon widget bàr-taoibh na duilleige gnìomhach (Bàr-taoibh Àite-pàighidh, Bàr-taoibh a’ Chairt, no Bàr-taoibh Òrdugh a Fhuaireadh). Rud eile, fuirichidh an duilleag mar aon cholbh le stoidhlichean Roinnt.','Split column background' => 'Cùl-raon colbh roinnte','Choose a background color for the Split design secondary column. Leave empty to use the order summary background color.' => 'Tagh dath cùl-fhiosrachaidh airson an dàrna colbh Dealbhadh roinnte. Fàg bàn gus dath cùl-fhiosrachaidh geàrr-chunntas an òrduigh a chleachdadh.','Page templates' => 'Teamplaidean duilleag','Checkout template' => 'Teamplaid pàighidh','Recommended for fewer distractions at checkout. <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/cart-abandonment" target="_blank">Read the research about cart abandonment</a>.' => 'Air a mholadh airson nas lugha de tharraing aire aig an àite-pàighidh. <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/cart-abandonment" target="_blank">Leugh an rannsachadh mu thrèigsinn chairtean</a> .','Sticky progress bar' => 'Bàr adhartais steigeach','Progress bar style' => 'Stoidhle bàr adhartais','Order totals' => 'Suimean òrdughan','Background color' => 'Dath cùl-raoin','Action link' => 'Ceangal gnìomh','Mobile order summary' => 'Geàrr-chunntas òrdugh gluasadach','Mobile initial state' => 'Staid tòiseachaidh gluasadach','Enable editing cart items at checkout' => 'Cuir comas air nithean cairt a dheasachadh aig an àite-pàighidh','Allow customers to change product quantities or remove items directly at the checkout page.' => 'Leig le luchd-ceannach meudan thoraidhean atharrachadh no nithean a thoirt air falbh gu dìreach aig duilleag an pàighidh.','Cart item errors' => 'Mearachdan ann an nì a’ chairt','Only applicable when coupon code is displayed as a separate section on the checkout or cart pages, and if use of coupon codes are enabled in the WooCommerce settings.' => 'Chan eil seo iomchaidh ach nuair a tha còd cùpain air a thaisbeanadh mar earrann air leth air duilleagan an àite-pàighidh no a’ chairt, agus ma tha cleachdadh chòdan cùpain air a chomasachadh anns na roghainnean WooCommerce.','Coupon codes position' => 'Suidheachadh chòdan cùpain','Apply coupon button' => 'Cuir a-steach am putan cùpón','Select style of the "apply coupon" button.' => 'Tagh stoidhle a’ phutan “cuir cùpón an sàs”.','Address line 2' => 'Loidhne seòlaidh 2','This setting is shared between the Checkout and Local pickup sections. On the Local pickup section, it also decides whether the Ship/Pickup selector shows inside the shipping method section (before the address) or as a separate section (after).' => 'Tha an roghainn seo air a roinn eadar na h-earrannan Àite-pàighidh agus Togail Ionadail. Anns an earrann Togail Ionadail, bidh e cuideachd a’ co-dhùnadh am bi an taghadair Luingeis/Togail a’ nochdadh taobh a-staigh earrann na modh luingeis (ron t-seòladh) no mar earrann air leth (às a dhèidh).','Customer accounts' => 'Cunntasan luchd-ceannach','Guest checkout' => 'Àite-pàighidh aoighean','Guest checkout, login, and account creation options from the WooCommerce Accounts settings page. They are managed here for your convenience, and so you can use different values per settings profile.' => 'Roghainnean pàighidh aoighean, logadh a-steach agus cruthachadh cunntas bhon duilleag roghainnean Cunntasan WooCommerce. Tha iad air an riaghladh an seo airson do ghoireasachd, agus mar sin faodaidh tu diofar luachan a chleachdadh gach pròifil roghainnean.','Allow customers to checkout without an account' => 'Leig le luchd-ceannach pàigheadh às aonais cunntas','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to create an account or log in during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>Air a mholadh</strong> gus nach tèid iarraidh air luchd-ceannach cunntas a chruthachadh no logadh a-steach aig àm an pàighidh, agus faodaidh seo ìrean tionndaidh a lughdachadh.','When disabled, customers must log in or create an account to complete the purchase.' => 'Nuair a bhios e à comas, feumaidh luchd-ceannach logadh a-steach no cunntas a chruthachadh gus an ceannach a chrìochnachadh.','Login at checkout' => 'Log a-steach aig an àite-pàighidh','Enable log-in during checkout' => 'Cuir an comas logadh a-steach aig àm pàighidh','Show a link for returning customers to log in from the checkout page.' => 'Seall ceangal airson luchd-ceannach a tha a’ tilleadh gus logadh a-steach bhon duilleag pàighidh.','Account creation' => 'Cruthachadh cunntais','Allow customers to create an account during checkout' => 'Leig le luchd-ceannach cunntas a chruthachadh aig àm pàighidh','Customers can create an account before placing their order.' => 'Faodaidh luchd-ceannach cunntas a chruthachadh mus cuir iad an òrdugh a-steach.','Allow customers to create an account from the My account page' => 'Leig le luchd-ceannach cunntas a chruthachadh bhon duilleag Mo Chunntas','Customers can register a new account from the My account page.' => 'Faodaidh luchd-ceannach cunntas ùr a chlàradh bhon duilleag Mo Chunntas.','Username' => 'Ainm-cleachdaiche','Generate from customer\'s name' => 'Gineadh bho ainm an neach-ceannach','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to choose a username during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>Air a mholadh</strong> gus nach tèid iarraidh air luchd-ceannach ainm-cleachdaiche a thaghadh aig àm pàighidh, agus faodaidh seo ìrean tionndaidh a lùghdachadh.','A username is generated from the customer name, or from the email address when a name cannot be used.' => 'Thèid ainm-cleachdaiche a chruthachadh bhon ainm a’ chustaimeir, no bhon t-seòladh puist-d nuair nach gabh ainm a chleachdadh.','Password' => 'Facal-faire','Send password setup link' => 'Cuir ceangal rèiteachaidh facal-faire','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to set a password during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>Air a mholadh</strong> gus nach tèid iarraidh air luchd-ceannach facal-faire a shuidheachadh aig àm an pàighidh, agus faodaidh seo ìrean tionndaidh a lùghdachadh.','Customers receive an email to create their password securely.' => 'Gheibh luchd-ceannach post-d gus am facal-faire aca a chruthachadh gu tèarainte.','Let registered customers complete checkout without logging in and associate the order with their existing account when contact details match.' => 'Leig le luchd-ceannach clàraichte an t-òrdugh a chrìochnachadh gun logadh a-steach agus an t-òrdugh a cheangal ris a’ chunntas a th’ aca mu thràth nuair a bhios am fiosrachadh conaltraidh a’ freagairt.','Existing account message' => 'Teachdaireachd cunntais a th’ ann mar-thà','Let customers create an account after placing their order, from the thank you page.' => 'Leig le luchd-ceannach cunntas a chruthachadh às dèidh dhaibh an òrdugh a chur, bhon duilleag taing.','Options in this section are available when guest checkout and account matching are enabled. Enable both features above to configure delayed account creation.' => 'Tha roghainnean san earrann seo rim faighinn nuair a bhios pàigheadh aoighean agus maidseadh cunntasan air an comasachadh. Cuir an dà fheart gu h-àrd an comas gus cruthachadh cunntas le dàil a rèiteachadh.','Enable delayed account creation' => 'Cuir an comas cruthachadh cunntas le dàil','Enable delayed account creation when both guest checkout and account matching are enabled.' => 'Cuir comas air cruthachadh cunntais le dàil nuair a bhios an dà chuid pàigheadh aoighean agus maidseadh cunntais air an comasachadh.','Section position' => 'Suidheachadh na h-earrainn','Before customer details section' => 'Roimh earrann mion-fhiosrachaidh luchd-ceannach','After customer details section' => 'Às dèidh earrann mion-fhiosrachaidh luchd-ceannach','Account creation benefits' => 'Buannachdan cruthachadh cunntais','Leaving the field empty will display the default text.' => 'Ma dh’fhàgas tu an raon falamh, nochdaidh an teacsa bunaiteach.','Inline buttons' => 'Putanan in-loidhne','Required fields' => 'Raointean riatanach','Enable gift message fields at checkout' => 'Cuir raointean teachdaireachd tiodhlac an gnìomh aig an àite-pàighidh','Expanded gift message' => 'Teachdaireachd tiodhlac leudaichte','Display gift message field always expanded' => 'Taisbean raon teachdaireachd tiodhlac an-còmhnaidh air a leudachadh','Gift message in order details' => 'Teachdaireachd tiodhlac ann am mion-fhiosrachadh an òrduigh','No integrations available at the moment on this section. The options related to each plugin and theme will only appear here when that plugin or theme is activated.' => 'Chan eil amalachadh sam bith ri fhaighinn an-dràsta san earrann seo. Cha nochd na roghainnean co-cheangailte ri gach plugan agus cuspair an seo ach nuair a thèid am plugan no an cuspair sin a ghnìomhachadh.','Phone fields' => 'Achaidhean fòn','Field visibility' => 'Faicsinneachd achaidh','Field position' => 'Suidheachadh na pàirce','Phone country code & validation' => 'Còd dùthcha fòn &amp; dearbhadh','Country' => 'Dùthaich','Enable country on phone fields' => 'Cuir an comas dùthaich air raointean fòn','Filter countries for shipping or billing' => 'Criathraich dùthchannan airson luingearachd no bileachadh','Limit the country selector on each phone field to the countries allowed for shipping or billing on your store.' => 'Cuir crìoch air an taghadh dùthcha air gach raon fòn gu na dùthchannan a tha ceadaichte airson lìbhrigeadh no bileachadh air a’ bhùth agad.','Validation' => 'Dearbhadh','Enable simple validation based on country rules' => 'Cuir dearbhadh sìmplidh an gnìomh stèidhichte air riaghailtean dùthcha','Checks that the phone number is valid for the selected country, including country code and length.' => 'Dèan cinnteach gu bheil an àireamh fòn dligheach airson na dùthcha a chaidh a thaghadh, a’ gabhail a-steach còd na dùthcha agus an fhaid.','Stricter check that the number is a valid mobile, fixed line, or other accepted type for the selected country. May reject some valid numbers.' => 'Sgrùdadh nas teinne a bheil an àireamh na seòrsa fòn-làimhe, loidhne stèidhichte, no seòrsa eile a tha air a ghabhail ris airson na dùthcha a chaidh a thaghadh. Dh’ fhaodadh gun tèid cuid de na h-àireamhan dligheach a dhiùltadh.','Validation types' => 'Seòrsachan dearbhaidh','Placeholders' => 'Luchd-àite','No license keys to manage at the moment. License keys will appear here when a licensed Fluid Checkout plugin or add-on is active.' => 'Chan eil iuchraichean ceadachais ann ri riaghladh an-dràsta. Nochdaidh iuchraichean ceadachais an seo nuair a bhios plugan no tuilleadan ceadachdaichte Fluid Checkout gnìomhach.','Default delivery type' => 'Seòrsa lìbhrigidh bunaiteach','Choose which delivery type will be selected by default.' => 'Tagh dè an seòrsa lìbhrigidh a thèid a thaghadh gu bunaiteach.','Shipping zone fields' => 'Achaidhean sòn luingeis','Choose which fields will be displayed for the local pickup shipping zone filter fields. Leave empty to show all available options.' => 'Tagh dè na raointean a thèid a thaisbeanadh airson raointean sìoltachaidh sòn togail luingeis ionadail. Fàg bàn gus na roghainnean uile a tha rim faighinn a shealltainn.','These fields will be displayed as a filter for the local pickup shipping methods. Some fields might still appear at checkout when not selected here, if compatible plugins require them to work properly.' => 'Thèid na raointean seo a thaisbeanadh mar chriathrag airson na dòighean luingeis togail ionadail. Dh’fhaodadh cuid de raointean nochdadh fhathast aig an àite-pàighidh mura h-eil iad air an taghadh an seo, ma tha feum aca orra obrachadh gu ceart airson plugins co-chòrdail.','Order shipping address' => 'Seòladh lìbhrigidh an òrduigh','Order pay page optimization' => 'Leasachadh duilleag pàighidh òrdughan','Give unpaid orders the same clear, conversion-focused layout as checkout.' => 'Thoir an aon chruth soilleir, stèidhichte air tionndadh, do òrdughan gun phàigheadh ri pàigheadh.','Optimize the layout of the order pay page for orders pending payment.' => 'Dèan cruth na duilleige pàighidh òrduigh nas fheàrr airson òrdughan a tha ri pàigheadh.','Match the order pay experience to your checkout for a consistent purchase journey.' => 'Maidseadh an t-eòlas pàighidh òrduigh ris an àite-pàighidh agad airson turas ceannach cunbhalach.','Add trust symbols and badges where shoppers need reassurance before paying.' => 'Cuir samhlaidhean agus bràistean earbsa ris far a bheil feum aig luchd-ceannach air dearbhadh mus pàigh iad.','Thank you page optimization' => 'Tapadh leibh airson leasachadh duilleag','Make the thank you page and order details clearer for customers after they buy.' => 'Dèan an duilleag taing agus mion-fhiosrachadh an òrduigh nas soilleire do luchd-ceannach às dèidh dhaibh ceannach.','Optimize the thank you page and account order details with a clearer layout.' => 'Leasaich duilleag na taing agus mion-fhiosrachadh òrdugh a’ chunntais le cruth nas soilleire.','Show order status progress, actions, downloads, and notes where they make sense.' => 'Seall adhartas inbhe an òrduigh, gnìomhan, luchdachadh sìos, agus notaichean far a bheil iad a’ dèanamh ciall.','Customize order details sections on email notifications.' => 'Gnàthaich earrannan mion-fhiosrachaidh òrduigh air fiosan post-d.','Add trust symbols and badges where shoppers need reassurance after purchase.' => 'Cuir samhlaidhean agus bràistean earbsa ris far a bheil feum aig luchd-ceannach air misneachd às dèidh ceannach.','Email notifications' => 'Fiosan post-d','Enable thank you page and order details optimizations to see more options' => 'Cuir an comas duilleag taing agus mion-fhiosrachadh òrduigh a leasachadh gus barrachd roghainnean fhaicinn','Use wide layout on thank you page' => 'Cleachd cruth farsaing air duilleag taing','These options affect the thank you page, view order details on account pages and on email notifications.' => 'Bidh na roghainnean seo a’ toirt buaidh air an duilleag taing, a’ faicinn mion-fhiosrachadh an òrduigh air duilleagan cunntais agus air fiosan post-d.','Save settings' => 'Sàbhail roghainnean','Docs' => 'Sgrìobhainnean','Cart' => 'Cairt','Thank you' => 'Tapadh leat','Address autocomplete' => 'Seòladh a chrìochnachadh gu fèin-ghluasadach','Trust badges' => 'Bràistean earbsa','You do not have permission to save these settings.' => 'Chan eil cead agad na roghainnean seo a shàbhaladh.','Invalid save request.' => 'Iarrtas sàbhalaidh mì-dhligheach.','Your settings have been saved.' => 'Chaidh na roghainnean agad a shàbhaladh.','Saving...' => 'A’ sàbhaladh...','Settings could not be saved. Please try again.' => 'Cha b’ urrainnear na roghainnean a shàbhaladh. Feuch ris a-rithist.','Dismiss notice' => 'Cuir às don bhrath','Open settings menu' => 'Fosgail clàr-taice nan roghainnean','Close settings menu' => 'Dùin clàr-taice nan roghainnean','Preview' => 'Ro-shealladh','Expand preview' => 'Leudaich ro-shealladh','Collapse preview' => 'Ro-shealladh dùmhail','Show header and footer' => 'Seall ceann-sgrìobhaidh agus bonn-sgrìobhaidh','Hide header and footer' => 'Falaich ceann-sgrìobhaidh agus bonn-sgrìobhaidh','Page preview' => 'Ro-shealladh na duilleige','Preview viewport' => 'Ro-shealladh den phort-seallaidh','Tablet' => 'Clàr','Desktop' => 'Deasg','Preview width' => 'Leud ro-shealladh','Decrease width' => 'Lùghdaich leud','Preview width in pixels' => 'Leud ro-shealladh ann am piogsail','Increase width' => 'Meudaich leud','Preview as' => 'Ro-shealladh mar','Guest' => 'Aoigh','Logged in' => 'Logaichte a-steach','Preview page' => 'Duilleag ro-shealladh','Expand preview for a closer look' => 'Leudaich ro-shealladh airson sealladh nas mionaidiche','Available with %s.' => 'Ri fhaighinn le %s.','Turn them on' => 'Cuir air iad','Optimizations for this page are turned off. %s to preview the page.' => 'Tha na h-optamachaidhean airson na duilleige seo dheth. %s gus ro-shealladh den duilleag fhaighinn.','%s preview' => 'Ro-shealladh %s','Isolated session · nothing is saved' => 'Seisean iomallach · chan eil dad air a shàbhaladh','Usage tracking' => 'Tracadh cleachdaidh','Send non-sensitive site environment reports to help Fluid Checkout improve compatibility. Reports are not sent until enabled in the options below.' => 'Cuir aithisgean àrainneachd làraich neo-mhothachail gus cuideachadh le Fluid Checkout co-chòrdalachd a leasachadh. Cha tèid aithisgean a chur gus an tèid an comasachadh anns na roghainnean gu h-ìosal.','Send usage tracking reports to Fluid Checkout' => 'Cuir aithisgean tracadh cleachdaidh gu Fluid Checkout','These reports help us improve compatibility and support for your site and are sent weekly when enabled.' => 'Bidh na h-aithisgean seo gar cuideachadh le bhith a’ leasachadh co-chòrdalachd agus taic airson an làraich agad agus thèid an cur a-mach gach seachdain nuair a bhios iad air an comasachadh.','No customer, admin user, or any other sensitive data is included in the reports.' => 'Chan eil dàta luchd-ceannach, neach-cleachdaidh rianaire, no dàta mothachail sam bith eile air a ghabhail a-steach anns na h-aithisgean.','Basic environment info' => 'Fiosrachadh bunaiteach mun àrainneachd','WordPress, PHP, WooCommerce, theme, and plugin list data. Always included when reporting is enabled. Helps us understand the environment your site is running in.' => 'Dàta liosta WordPress, PHP, WooCommerce, cuspairean, agus plugins. An-còmhnaidh air a ghabhail a-steach nuair a bhios aithris air a chomasachadh. Cuidichidh e sinn le bhith a’ tuigsinn na h-àrainneachd anns a bheil an làrach-lìn agad a’ ruith.','Plugin settings' => 'Roghainnean plugan','Sends Fluid Checkout plugin settings to help with support requests and helps us understand how you are using our plugins.' => 'Cuiridh e roghainnean plugan Fluid Checkout gus cuideachadh le iarrtasan taic agus gus ar cuideachadh le bhith a’ tuigsinn mar a tha thu a’ cleachdadh ar plugain.','Coming soon' => 'A’ tighinn a dh’ aithghearr','Sales metrics' => 'Meatairean reic','Monthly order count and total sales for one year prior to installing Fluid Checkout up to today. Helps us understand if you are making more money with our plugins installed. No customer or user data is ever sent.' => 'Àireamh òrdughan mìosail agus reic iomlan airson bliadhna mus deach Fluid Checkout a stàladh gu ruige seo. Cuidichidh seo sinn le bhith a’ tuigsinn a bheil thu a’ dèanamh barrachd airgid leis na plugins againn air an stàladh. Cha tèid dàta luchd-ceannach no luchd-cleachdaidh a chuir a-riamh.','Utilities' => 'Goireasan','Use <code>TomSelect</code> dropdown components instead of <code>select2</code>' => 'Cleachd co-phàirtean clàr-taice <code>TomSelect</code> an àite <code>select2</code>','TomSelect is a simpler dropdown selection component which is less prone to errors than Select2, while offering the same functionality.' => '&#39;S e TomSelect pàirt taghaidh tuiteam-sìos nas sìmplidh a tha nas lugha buailteach do mhearachdan na Select2, agus aig an aon àm a&#39; tabhann an aon ghnìomhachd.','Sets the font size inside form fields to 16px on pages optimized by this plugin to avoid automatically zooming in when interacting with form fields on small devices.' => 'Suidhichidh seo meud a’ chrutha-clò taobh a-staigh raointean foirm gu 16px air duilleagan a tha air an leasachadh leis a’ plugan seo gus casg a chuir air zoom a-steach gu fèin-ghluasadach nuair a bhios tu ag eadar-obrachadh le raointean foirm air innealan beaga.','Safari and other browsers might automatically zoom in on mobile devices to make the text easier to read when the font size is smaller than 16px.' => 'Dh’fhaodadh Safari agus brobhsairean eile zoom a-steach gu fèin-ghluasadach air innealan-làimhe gus an teacsa a dhèanamh nas fhasa a leughadh nuair a tha meud a’ chruth-clò nas lugha na 16px.','Enable script processing tracking on the browser console.' => 'Cuir an comas tracadh giollachd sgriobtaichean air consol a’ bhrabhsair.','Unminified assets' => 'So-mhaoin neo-mhion-leasaichte','Google Maps scripts' => 'Sgriobtaichean Google Maps','Do not remove duplicate Google Maps scripts' => 'Na toir air falbh sgriobtaichean Google Maps dùblaichte','When enabled, duplicate Google Maps scripts will NOT be removed which can cause errors and performance issues. Only use this option while troubleshooting.' => 'Nuair a bhios e air a chomasachadh, cha tèid sgriobtaichean Google Maps dùblaichte a thoirt air falbh agus faodaidh seo mearachdan agus duilgheadasan coileanaidh adhbhrachadh. Cleachd an roghainn seo a-mhàin nuair a bhios tu a’ fuasgladh dhuilgheadasan.','Widget areas' => 'Raointean widget','Last step on mobile' => 'An ceum mu dheireadh air fòn-làimhe','Display widgets only at last step on mobile' => 'Taisbean widgets aig a’ cheum mu dheireadh air fòn-làimhe a-mhàin','Display checkout trust badge widgets only when viewing the last checkout step on mobile devices' => 'Seall widgets bràiste earbsa aig àm pàighidh a-mhàin nuair a choimheadas tu air a’ cheum mu dheireadh aig àm pàighidh air innealan gluasadach.','Standard' => 'Coitcheann','VAT number field' => 'Raon àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte','Add a VAT number field to the billing form.' => 'Cuir raon àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte ris an fhoirm bileachaidh.','Field label' => 'Leubail achaidh','Set the label of the VAT number field (ie. VAT number). On multi-language websites, it is better to leave this field empty and translate the original string.' => 'Suidhich leubail achaidh àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte (m.e. àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte). Air làraichean-lìn ioma-chànanach, tha e nas fheàrr an raon seo fhàgail falamh agus an sreang thùsail eadar-theangachadh.','VAT Number' => 'Àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte','EU-VAT' => 'Cìs Luach-Leasaichte an EU','Enable the VAT number field to see more options' => 'Cuir an raon àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte an gnìomh gus barrachd roghainnean fhaicinn','VAT validation' => 'Dearbhadh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte','Validate VAT number field for EU-VAT during checkout' => 'Dearbhaich raon àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte airson Cìs Luach-Leasaichte an EU aig àm pàighidh','Checks if the VAT Number provided is a valid VAT number registered on the European VIES Database (VAT Information Exchange System).' => 'Bidh seo a’ dèanamh cinnteach a bheil an Àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte a chaidh a thoirt seachad na àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte dligheach a tha clàraichte air Stòr-dàta VIES na h-Eòrpa (Siostam Iomlaid Fiosrachaidh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte).','Shop VAT number' => 'Àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte a&#39; bhùtha','The shop\'s VAT number used for requesting EU-VAT validation, and printed on invoices. <br><strong>We strongly recommend adding your Shop VAT number</strong> as otherwise the VIES consultation results might not be valid for accounting purposes. <br>Ie.: <code>ATU99999999</code> or <code>EE999999999</code>.' => 'Àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte na bùtha a thathar a’ cleachdadh airson dearbhadh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte an EU iarraidh, agus a tha clò-bhuailte air cunntasan-creideis.<br> <strong>Tha sinn a’ moladh gu làidir gun cuir thu àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte na Bùtha agad</strong> ris oir air dhòigh eile is dòcha nach bi toraidhean co-chomhairle VIES dligheach airson adhbharan cunntasachd.<br> Ie.: <code>ATU99999999</code> no <code>EE999999999</code> .','Reverse charge' => 'Cosgais air ais','Apply reverse charge mechanism' => 'Cuir an sàs uidheam cosgais cùil','Set tax rate to zero and display "Reverse charge" on invoices when the customer\'s VAT number is valid. A different "Reverse charge" text might be required depending on the store\'s country.' => 'Suidhich an ìre cìse gu neoni agus taisbein “Cosgais air ais” air cunntasan nuair a tha àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte an neach-ceannach dligheach. Dh’ fhaodadh gum bi feum air teacsa eadar-dhealaichte “Cosgais air ais” a rèir dùthaich a’ bhùtha.','Same country' => 'An aon dùthaich','Apply reverse charge mechanism for transactions in the shop country:' => 'Cuir an sàs dòigh-obrach cosgais-aisig airson gnothaichean ann an dùthaich na bùtha:','Enables applying reverse charge mechanism for transactions between companies in the same country as the shop.' => 'A’ comasachadh cleachdadh uidheam cosgais-aisig airson gnothaichean eadar companaidhean san aon dùthaich ris a’ bhùth.','Reverse charge exceptions' => 'Eisgeachdan cosgais droim-air-ais','Select additional countries to skip applying the reverse charge mechanism.' => 'Tagh dùthchannan a bharrachd gus nach cuir thu an sàs an dòigh-obrach cosgais-aisig.','Taxes will be charged to orders from these countries even when a valid VAT number is provided.' => 'Thèid cìsean a chur air òrdughan às na dùthchannan sin eadhon ged a thèid àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte dligheach a thoirt seachad.','Reverse charge label on invoices' => 'Leubail cosgais-aisig air cunntasan','Set the label of "reverse charge" on the checkout page and order details.' => 'Suidhich an leubail “cosgais cùil” air duilleag an pàighidh agus mion-fhiosrachadh an òrduigh.','Reverse charge text on invoices' => 'Teacsa cosgais-aisig air cunntasan','Set the label of "reverse charge" text on invoices.' => 'Suidhich an leubail teacsa “cosgais cùil” air cunntasan.','Tax to be paid on reverse charge basis' => 'Cìs ri phàigheadh air bunait cosgais droim-air-ais','Company name' => 'Ainm a&#39; chompanaidh','Autocomplete company name from VAT number' => 'Ainm a’ chompanaidh a lìonadh gu fèin-ghluasadach bhon àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte','Fill in the billing company name based on the valid VAT number provided by the customer.' => 'Lìon a-steach ainm a’ chompanaidh bileachaidh stèidhichte air an àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte dligheach a thug an neach-ceannach seachad.','Company name editing' => 'Deasachadh ainm a’ chompanaidh','Allow editing of auto-filled company name' => 'Leig le deasachadh ainm companaidh a chaidh a lìonadh gu fèin-ghluasadach','When enabled, customers can change the company name associated with the provided VAT number.' => 'Nuair a bhios e air a chomasachadh, faodaidh luchd-ceannach ainm a’ chompanaidh atharrachadh a tha co-cheangailte ris an àireamh Cìs Luach-Leasaichte a chaidh a thoirt seachad.','EU-VAT for digital goods' => 'Cìs-luach-airgid an EU airson bathar didseatach','From January 1st, 2015, modifications have been made to the EU VAT regulations concerning digital goods, impacting exclusively B2C transactions. The VAT on digital goods must be calculated based on the customer\'s location, and evidence of this needs to be collected (IP address and billing address).' => 'Bho 1 Faoilleach 2015, chaidh atharrachaidhean a dhèanamh air riaghailtean Cìs Luach-Leasaichte an EU a thaobh bathar didseatach, a’ toirt buaidh a-mhàin air gnothaichean B2C. Feumar Cìs Luach-Leasaichte air bathar didseatach obrachadh a-mach a rèir àite an neach-ceannach, agus feumar fianais air seo a chruinneachadh (seòladh IP agus seòladh bileachaidh).','Tax classes for digital goods' => 'Clasaichean cìse airson bathar didseatach','Select some tax classes' => 'Tagh cuid de chlasaichean cìse','Location evidence' => 'Fianais air an àite','Collect customer\'s location evidence' => 'Cruinnich fianais mu àite an neach-ceannach','Saves the IP address and validate it against the customer\'s billing address. Customer\'s must confirm their billing address by checking a checkbox on the checkout page if the country from their billing address and IP do not match.' => 'Sàbhalaidh e an seòladh IP agus dearbhaidh e e an aghaidh seòladh bileachaidh an neach-ceannach. Feumaidh luchd-ceannach an seòladh bileachaidh aca a dhearbhadh le bhith a’ cur tic ann am bogsa-seic air duilleag an àite-pàighidh mura h-eil an dùthaich bhon t-seòladh bileachaidh aca agus an seòladh IP aca a’ freagairt.','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. <a href="%s">Change it in Customer accounts settings</a>.' => 'Tha an roghainn seo air a riaghladh ann am Fluid Checkout. <a href="%s">Atharraich e ann an roghainnean cunntasan Luchd-ceannach</a> .','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. Change it under Fluid Checkout > Customer accounts.' => 'Tha an roghainn seo air a riaghladh ann am Fluid Checkout. Atharraich e fo Fluid Checkout &gt; Cunntasan luchd-ceannach.','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. The shipping destination is always set to "Default to customer shipping address" when Fluid Checkout is activated. Customers can still provide different shipping and billing addresses during checkout.<br><br>An option for setting the default billing address to be the same as the shipping address is available in the <a href="%s">Fluid Checkout settings</a>.' => 'Tha an roghainn seo air a riaghladh ann am Fluid Checkout. Bidh an ceann-uidhe lìbhrigidh an-còmhnaidh air a shuidheachadh gu &quot;Seòladh lìbhrigidh àbhaisteach do luchd-ceannach&quot; nuair a thèid Fluid Checkout a ghnìomhachadh. Faodaidh luchd-ceannach fhathast seòlaidhean lìbhrigidh is bileachaidh eadar-dhealaichte a thoirt seachad aig àm an pàighidh.<br><br> Tha roghainn ann anns na <a href="%s">roghainnean Fluid Checkout</a> airson an seòladh bileachaidh bunaiteach a shuidheachadh gus a bhith mar an ceudna ris an t-seòladh lìbhrigidh.','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. The shipping destination is always set to "Default to customer shipping address" when Fluid Checkout is activated. Customers can still provide different shipping and billing addresses during checkout.<br><br>An option for setting the default billing address to be the same as the shipping address is available at WooCommerce > Settings > Fluid Checkout.' => 'Tha an roghainn seo air a riaghladh ann am Fluid Checkout. Bidh an ceann-uidhe lìbhrigidh an-còmhnaidh air a shuidheachadh gu &quot;Seòladh lìbhrigidh àbhaisteach do luchd-ceannach&quot; nuair a thèid Fluid Checkout a ghnìomhachadh. Faodaidh luchd-ceannach fhathast seòlaidhean lìbhrigidh is bileachaidh eadar-dhealaichte a thoirt seachad aig àm an pàighidh.<br><br> Tha roghainn ann airson an seòladh bileachaidh bunaiteach a shuidheachadh gus a bhith mar an ceudna ris an t-seòladh lìbhrigidh aig WooCommerce &gt; Roghainnean &gt; Fluid Checkout.','These settings have been moved to WP Admin > Fluid Checkout > Settings.' => 'Chaidh na roghainnean seo a ghluasad gu WP Admin &gt; Fluid Checkout &gt; Roghainnean.','This WooCommerce Settings tab is deprecated and will be removed in Fluid Checkout 6.0.' => 'Tha an taba Roghainnean WooCommerce seo air a chur à bith agus thèid a thoirt air falbh ann an Fluid Checkout 6.0.','Go to settings page' => 'Rach gu duilleag nan roghainnean','Hide this tab permanently' => 'Falaich an taba seo gu buan','Site report preview' => 'Ro-shealladh aithisg làraich','This is the data that would be included in the next site environment report based on your current settings.' => 'Is e seo an dàta a bhiodh air a ghabhail a-steach san ath aithisg àrainneachd làraich stèidhichte air na roghainnean làithreach agad.','Loading report preview...' => 'A’ luchdachadh ro-shealladh na h-aithisg...','Could not load the site report preview. Try again.' => 'Cha b’ urrainnear ro-shealladh aithisg na làraich a luchdachadh. Feuch ris a-rithist.','Could not send the site report. Try again.' => 'Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn aithisg na làraich a chur. Feuch ris a-rithist.','Site report sent successfully.' => 'Aithisg làraich air a cur gu soirbheachail.','Enable and send now' => 'Cuir an comas agus cuir a-nis','Close' => 'Dùin','A site report request is already in progress. Try again in a moment.' => 'Tha iarrtas airson aithisg làraich ga phròiseasadh mu thràth. Feuch ris a-rithist ann am mionaid.','Site environment reporting is disabled.' => 'Tha aithris air àrainneachd na làraich à comas.','No site report data is available to send.' => 'Chan eil dàta aithisg làraich ri fhaighinn airson a chur.','This site domain cannot send environment reports (local or development domains are excluded).' => 'Chan urrainn don àrainn làraich seo aithisgean àrainneachd a chur (chan eil àrainnean ionadail no leasachaidh air an gabhail a-steach).','A site report was sent recently. Try again later.' => 'Chaidh aithisg làraich a chur o chionn ghoirid. Feuch ris a-rithist nas fhaide air adhart.','The site report could not be sent. Try again later.' => 'Cha b’ urrainnear an aithisg làraich a chur. Feuch ris a-rithist nas fhaide air adhart.','Site environment reporting is not available.' => 'Chan eil aithris air àrainneachd làraich ri fhaighinn.','No site report data is available for the selected settings.' => 'Chan eil dàta aithisg làraich ri fhaighinn airson nan roghainnean a chaidh a thaghadh.','You are not allowed to manage site reports.' => 'Chan eil cead agad aithisgean làraich a riaghladh.','PRO feature' => 'Feart PRO','Other plugins' => 'Plugins eile','Get only this add-on &mdash; %s' => 'Faigh an tuilleadan seo a-mhàin — %s','Install add-on' => 'Stàlaich an tuilleadan','Upgrade to PRO &mdash; %s' => 'Ùraich gu PRO — %s','<a target="_blank" href="%1$s">Get %2$s</a> to unlock these options.' => '<a target="_blank" href="%1$s">Faigh %2$s</a> gus na roghainnean seo fhuasgladh.','Add-on' => 'Cuir-ris','View documentation' => 'Seall sgrìobhainnean','Requests require a logged-in WordPress user. Omit user_id to use the current user\'s data, or pass user_id to target another account when the caller can edit that user (edit_user capability). Unauthenticated requests return fc_api_forbidden. An invalid user_id returns fc_api_user_not_found.' => 'Feumaidh iarrtasan cleachdaiche WordPress a tha air logadh a-steach. Leig seachad user_id gus dàta an neach-cleachdaidh làithreach a chleachdadh, no thoir seachad user_id gus cunntas eile a thargaideadh nuair as urrainn don neach-gairm an neach-cleachdaidh sin a dheasachadh (comas edit_user). Bidh iarrtasan neo-dhearbhte a’ tilleadh fc_api_forbidden. Bidh user_id neo-dhligheach a’ tilleadh fc_api_user_not_found.','HTTP 200 with { "data": { ... } } when the handler returns a payload.' => 'HTTP 200 le { &quot;dàta&quot;: { ... } } nuair a bhios an làimhsichear a’ tilleadh luchd.','HTTP 200 with { "success": true } when there is no payload (for example DELETE).' => 'HTTP 200 le { &quot;success&quot;: true } nuair nach eil luchd ann (mar eisimpleir DELETE).','Failures return WordPress REST error JSON from WP_Error (code, message, data.status). Wire codes use the fc_api_* prefix.' => 'Bidh fàilligidhean a’ tilleadh mearachd REST WordPress JSON bho WP_Error (còd, teachdaireachd, dàta.status). Bidh còdan uèir a’ cleachdadh an ro-leasachan fc_api_*.','Forbidden access.' => 'Cothrom toirmisgte.','Target user was not found.' => 'Cha deach an neach-cleachdaidh targaid a lorg.','This feature is not available.' => 'Chan eil an feart seo ri fhaighinn.','A required address field is missing.' => 'Tha raon seòlaidh riatanach a dhìth.','Postcode or ZIP is invalid.' => 'Tha a’ chòd-puist no an còd-puist neo-dhligheach.','Phone number is invalid.' => 'Tha an àireamh fòn mì-dhligheach.','State or county is invalid.' => 'Tha stàit no siorrachd neo-dhligheach.','Country is invalid or has no address fields.' => 'Tha an dùthaich neo-dhligheach no chan eil raointean seòlaidh innte.','The request could not be processed.' => 'Cha b’ urrainnear an t-iarrtas a phròiseasadh.','Back to previous step' => 'Air ais chun cheum roimhe','Skip to settings' => 'Leum gu roghainnean','Start over and return to the first guided setup step' => 'Tòisich a-rithist agus till air ais chun a’ chiad cheum rèiteachaidh treòraichte','Start over' => 'Tòisich a-rithist','Please complete all sub-steps before continuing.' => 'Feuch an lìon thu a h-uile fo-cheum mus lean thu air adhart.','Expand' => 'Leudaich','Collapse' => 'Crìonadh','Skip' => 'Leum','Mark as complete' => 'Comharraich mar chrìochnaichte','Mark as incomplete' => 'Comharraich mar neo-choileanta','View full-size image: %s' => 'Seall ìomhaigh làn-mheud: %s','Full-size setup guide image' => 'Ìomhaigh làn-mheud den stiùireadh rèiteachaidh','Close image' => 'Dùin an dealbh','Fluid Checkout Guided Setup' => 'Suidheachadh Treòraichte airson Seic Fluid','Welcome' => 'Fàilte','Explore your checkout' => 'Rannsaich an t-àite-pàighidh agad','All set' => 'Uile deiseil','You do not have permission to access this page.' => 'Chan eil cead agad faighinn chun na duilleige seo.','Go to step %1$d: %2$s' => 'Rach gu ceum %1$d: %2$s','This guided setup helps you get familiar with Fluid Checkout. The steps below are placeholders for now.' => 'Cuidichidh an stiùireadh seo thu gus eòlas fhaighinn air Fluid Checkout. Tha na ceumannan gu h-ìosal nan àiteachan-gleidhidh an-dràsta.','Continue to the next step when you are ready.' => 'Lean air adhart chun ath cheum nuair a bhios tu deiseil.','Open your store checkout to see Fluid Checkout in action.' => 'Fosgail an àite-pàighidh agad sa bhùth gus faicinn dè tha Fluid Checkout ag obair.','View checkout page' => 'Seall duilleag an àite-pàighidh','You can return to Fluid Checkout settings to continue configuring your store.' => 'Faodaidh tu tilleadh gu roghainnean Fluid Checkout gus leantainn air adhart a’ rèiteachadh do bhùtha.','Review checkout and cart settings' => 'Thoir sùil air roghainnean an àite-pàighidh agus a’ chairt','Explore add-ons from the dashboard' => 'Rannsaich na breisean bhon deas-bhòrd','Finish & go to settings' => 'Crìochnaich &amp; rach gu roghainnean','Update the billing phone field visibility option from the legacy value to match WooCommerce conventions.' => 'Ùraich an roghainn faicsinneachd achaidh fòn bileachaidh bhon luach seann-fhasanta gus a bhith a rèir gnàthasan WooCommerce.','Update the shipping phone field visibility option from the legacy value to match WooCommerce conventions.' => 'Ùraich an roghainn faicsinneachd achaidh fòn luingeis bhon luach seann-fhasanta gus a bhith a rèir gnàthasan WooCommerce.','Copy the order summary background color setting to the new Split design secondary column background color option.' => 'Dèan lethbhreac de roghainn dath cùl-fhiosrachaidh geàrr-chunntas an òrduigh chun roghainn dath cùl-fhiosrachaidh colbh àrd-sgoile ùr airson dealbhadh roinnte.','The enhanced select fields feature is always disabled when using the Biteship plugin.' => 'Bidh am feart leasaichte airson raointean a thaghadh an-còmhnaidh à comas nuair a thathar a’ cleachdadh am plugan Biteship.','The place order position is always set to "Below the order summary" when using German Market. That plugin requires the place order button and legal checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary.' => 'Bidh suidheachadh an òrduigh-àite an-còmhnaidh air a shuidheachadh gu &quot;Fon gheàrr-chunntas an òrduigh&quot; nuair a thathar a’ cleachdadh Margaidh na Gearmailt. Feumaidh am plugan sin am putan òrduigh-àite agus bogsaichean-seic laghail a bhith air an taisbeanadh fon gheàrr-chunntas òrduigh.','The place order position is always set to "Below the order summary" when using Germanized for WooCommerce. That plugin requires the place order button and legal checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary.' => 'Bidh suidheachadh an òrduigh-àite an-còmhnaidh air a shuidheachadh gu &quot;Fon gheàrr-chunntas an òrduigh&quot; nuair a thathar a’ cleachdadh Gearmailtis airson WooCommerce. Feumaidh am plugan sin am putan òrduigh-àite agus bogsaichean-seic laghail a bhith air an taisbeanadh fon gheàrr-chunntas òrduigh.','Edit pickup locations' => 'Deasaich àiteachan togail','Use local pickup label from WooCommerce settings' => 'Cleachd leubail togail ionadail bho roghainnean WooCommerce','When enabled, the pickup option label on checkout matches the title from WooCommerce pickup location settings. When disabled, the label uses the translatable "Local pickup" text from Fluid Checkout.' => 'Nuair a bhios e comasach, bidh an leubail roghainn togail aig an àite-pàighidh a’ freagairt ris an tiotal bho roghainnean àite togail WooCommerce. Nuair a bhios e à comas, bidh an leubail a’ cleachdadh an teacsa “Togail ionadail” a ghabhas eadar-theangachadh bho Fluid Checkout.','Button label for applying coupon codesApply' => 'Cuir a-steach','Checkout step titleContact' => 'Cuir fios','Checkout step titleShipping' => 'Luingearachd','Checkout step titleBilling' => 'Bile','Checkout step titlePayment' => 'Pàigheadh','Checkout substep change link labelChange' => 'Atharraich','Checkout substep save link labelSave changes' => 'Sàbhail atharraichea