'Dummy product name in the admin previewCap' => 'Caip','Dummy product name in the admin previewT-Shirt' => 'Lèine-T','Dummy order update in the admin previewWe received your order and will send you an update when it ships.' => 'Fhuair sinn an t-òrdugh agad agus cuiridh sinn ùrachadh thugad nuair a thèid a chur air falbh.','Dummy download in the admin previewUser guide' => 'Stiùireadh cleachdaiche','Google Places API versionsPlaces API (New)' => 'API Àiteachan (Ùr)','Google Places API versionsPlaces API (Legacy)' => 'API Àiteachan (Dìleab)','Brasil API versionsVersion 1' => 'Tionndadh 1','Brasil API versionsVersion 2' => 'Tionndadh 2','Delayed account creation benefits placeholder text✔ Checkout faster next time
